# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:8
translate english c17_32c3c0e6:

    # "{b}Esto es todo por esta versión. Por favor, graba aquí y nos vemos en la próxima actualización de My Dorm. Gracias por jugar y por tu apoyo. Espero que hayas disfrutado del juego.{/b}"
    "{b}That's it for this update. Please save here and see you in the next update of My Dorm. Thank you for playing and for your support. I hope you enjoyed the game.{/b}"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:35
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d0af28a5:

    # mc "¡Amanda! ¡Estás preciosa!"
    mc "Amanda, you look gorgeous!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:37
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_afb86a32:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Has dicho que para la cena sería mejor un vestido y..."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]. You said that a dress would be better for dinner and..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:38
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8f743db4:

    # mc "Y has elegido uno que te queda perfecto. ¿Vamos?"
    mc "And you've picked one that fits you perfectly. Shall we?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:40
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_24f1a87e:

    # ama "Sí, por favor, no quiero llegar tarde y que se lleven una mala primera impresión."
    ama "Yes, please, I don't want to be late and give them a bad first impression."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:41
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5defb41a:

    # mc "Amanda, ¿realmente crees que alguien va a mirar el reloj cuando te vean?"
    mc "Amanda, do you really think anyone is going to check their watch when they see you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:42
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_93251535:

    # mc "Todo el mundo está deseando conocerte, y más aún después del éxito de Eva durante la comida."
    mc "Everyone is looking forward to meeting you, and even more so after Eva's success during lunch."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:44
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_483c8d97:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. No sé qué has hecho, pero ha vuelto entusiasmada."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]. I don't know what you've done, but she's returned here very enthusiastic."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:45
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_74a7e7da:

    # mc "¿No tenéis cámaras en la cocina de [nor]?"
    mc "Don't you have cameras in [nor]'s kitchen?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:47
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_80c2d0a9:

    # ama "Sí, pero he dejado de mirarlas cuando le has presentado a [emm]."
    ama "Yes, but I stopped looking at them when you introduced her to [emm]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:48
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_68787dac:

    # ama "Me estaba entrando envidia cuando [mar] y [nor] han abrazado a Eva. Más envidia todavía con [eri]."
    ama "I was getting envious when [mar] and [nor] hugged Eva. Even more jealous when [eri] did it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:50
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2db2420f:

    # ama "Pero con [emm] me ha entrado frustración. Ya estaba frustrada por cómo había tratado a [mar] esta mañana, pero..."
    ama "But I got frustrated with [emm]. I was already frustrated with how she treated [mar] this morning, but..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:51
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b4791f68:

    # mc "No le des más vueltas. Es [emm], y muchas veces solo necesita que alguien le haga pensar antes de darse cuenta que su reacción ha sido... excesiva."
    mc "Don't give it any more thought. She's [emm] and, a lot of times, she just needs someone to make her think before she realizes her reaction has been... excessive."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:53
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5bd12c5f:

    # ama "Lo sé. Después de estos meses viendo a alguien con mi cara actuando como yo no lo haría nunca... te aseguro que lo sé."
    ama "I know. After these months of seeing someone with my face acting like I never would... I can tell you for sure I know."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:54
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_235c1e4d:

    # mc "¿Por eso te teñiste de rubio?"
    mc "Is that why you dyed your hair blonde?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:57
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_780b076e:

    # ama "¿Q-qué? ¡N-no! Lo hice por si acaso... había que seguiros a distancia. Un color diferente de pelo puede... cambiar la percepción del observador."
    ama "W-what? N-no! I did it just in case... you had to be followed from a distance. A different hair color can... change the observer's perception."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:58
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_07e61db0:

    # mc "Ah, OK. Como en las películas cuando los espías se ponen una peluca."
    mc "Ah, OK. Like in the movies, when the spies put on a wig."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:59
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c5b80ac4:

    # ama "Sí... más o menos... ¿nos vamos?"
    ama "Yes... more or less... shall we go?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:61
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5f7d4099:

    # "Tenéis una conversación tensa en el coche. Casi tienes que sacarle las palabras una a una."
    "You have a tense conversation in the car. You almost have to pull the words out of her one by one."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:62
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_be1ffe17:

    # "Por fin llegáis a casa."
    "At last, you arrive home."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:64
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c697453e:

    # mc "¿Nerviosa?"
    mc "Nervous?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:65
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6ad6f704:

    # ama "Sí, mucho. Lo de ayer fue... inesperado."
    ama "Yes, very much so. Yesterday's reactions were... unexpected."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:66
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b81ae450:

    # ama "Lo que me ha contado hoy Eva de lo bien que se lo ha pasado... no sé... me da miedo."
    ama "What Eva told me today about how much fun she had... I don't know... it scares me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:68
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_35099ae7:

    # ama "¿Qué pasa si después vendéis la empresa? ¿Qué pasa si, una vez pase la novedad, no queréis que formemos parte de la familia?"
    ama "What if you sell the company? What if, once the novelty wears off, you don't want us to be part of the family?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:69
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b17e72d0:

    # mc "Eso no va a pasar, Amanda. Al menos lo último."
    mc "That's not going to happen, Amanda. At least the last part of it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:70
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3096ee28:

    # mc "No sé si venderemos la empresa o no. Será una decisión familiar, y aunque yo vote una cosa, ellas cinco pueden votar lo contrario."
    mc "I don't know if we will sell the company or not. It will be a family decision, and even if I vote for one thing, the five of them may vote the opposite."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:72
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a97ffd9f:

    # ama "*Gruñido* Lo sé. Y no saber lo que van a hacer... me tiene nerviosa. Para mí, esta cena no es solo para conocerlas, aunque sea lo más importante..."
    ama "*Grunt* I know. And not knowing what they're going to do... it's got me on edge. For me, this dinner isn't just about getting to know them, even if it's the most important thing..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:73
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_45dc4b83:

    # mc "Es también para que te conozcan, para que les pongan cara a las verdaderas víctimas de NTR. Vosotras, Aaron, y el resto, ¿no?"
    mc "It's also for them to get to know you, to put faces to the real NTR victims. You, Aaron, and the rest, right?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:75
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7181eaea:

    # ama "Eva estaba equivocada. Pillas las cosas más rápido de lo que parece."
    ama "Eva was wrong. You catch on to things faster than it looks."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:76
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_88dd2c30:

    # ama "Depende a quién le vendáis la empresa, si no os podemos pagar lo que pidáis, habrá más Aarons y más Erics. Más Fionas."
    ama "It depends on who you sell the company to. If we can't pay you what you ask, there will be more Aarons and more Erics. More Fionas."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:77
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_41f1e3d6:

    # mc "Si mi voto decanta la balanza, no venderemos. Pero dudo que mi voto sirva de mucho."
    mc "If my vote tips the balance, we won't sell. But I doubt my vote will do much good."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:79
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6a923f5c:

    # ama "¿Crees que van a querer vender? Entiendo que es mucho dinero..."
    ama "Do you think they will want to sell? I understand it's a lot of money..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:80
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b23d8247:

    # mc "[nor] y [mar] no van a querer que otras chicas o chicos pasen por lo que habéis pasado vosotras. Y estoy seguro de que no sabemos ni la mitad de lo que habéis pasado."
    mc "[nor] and [mar] won't want any other kids to go through what you've experienced. And I'm sure we don't know half of what you've lived through."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:81
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_93e5b0ff:

    # mc "[dap] ya está haciendo planes para trabajar en NTR. Mejor hacerlo como accionista, ¿no?"
    mc "[dap] is already making plans to work at NTR. Better to do it as a shareholder, right?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:82
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5e892a1c:

    # mc "Y [eri] es tan empática que, en cuanto entienda por lo que habéis pasado, estará en la misma posición que [mar] y [nor]."
    mc "And [eri] is so empathetic that, as soon as she understands what you have been through, she will be in the same position as [mar] and [nor]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:83
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_59511ffd:

    # mc "Mi voto y el de [emm] no servirían de nada."
    mc "My vote and [emm]'s would be useless."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:85
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_737bd48b:

    # ama "¿Votarías por venderla?"
    ama "Would you vote for selling it?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:86
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_edffed05:

    # mc "No. Si votase por venderla sería para vendérosla a vosotros, pero creo que es mejor no hacerlo. Creo que me gusta la idea de hacer que el viejo NTR desaparezca."
    mc "No. If I voted to sell it, it would be to sell it to you guys, but I think it's better not to. I think I like the idea of making the old NTR disappear."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:87
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_943e0d4f:

    # mc "Crear algo nuevo con lo que tenemos entre manos. Aunque no sé dónde encajaríais vosotras, Aaron, o el resto de los clones en esa visión."
    mc "Create something new with what we have on our hands. Although I don't know where you, Aaron, or the rest of the clones would fit into that vision."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:89
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_472929fa:

    # ama "Sobre eso... tengo varias ideas. ¿Te parece bien que tomemos un café un día y lo hablamos?"
    ama "About that... I have several ideas. Is it okay if we have a cup of coffee one day and talk about it?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:90
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1842c921:

    # mc "Me parece genial. Ahora deberíamos entrar."
    mc "Sounds great to me. Now we should go in."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:94
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_edb24cc0:

    # mc "Bueno, parece que toda la familia está aquí. *Risa* Vas a sufrir más que Eva."
    mc "Well, it looks like the whole family is here. *Laugh* You're going to suffer more than Eva."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:95
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_863fdac8:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Yo soporto... disfruto más de los abrazos que ella."
    ama "*Whispering* I endure... I enjoy hugging more than she does."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:97
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b2013db9:

    # "[mar] corre hacia Amanda y la envuelve en un abrazo."
    "[mar] runs to Amanda and wraps her in an embrace."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:98
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4b7ba78a:

    # mom "Bienvenida de nuevo a casa, Amanda."
    mom "Welcome home again, Amanda."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:99
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_481f2225:

    # ama "Gracias, [mar]."
    ama "Thank you, [mar]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:101
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e3d25341:

    # "Se repiten las presentaciones y los abrazos de la comida y la misma dinámica. Las chicas, esta vez también con las estudiantes, acaparan a Amanda mientras las mujeres se mantienen apartadas."
    "There is a repeat of the introductions and hugs at lunch and the same dynamic. The girls, this time also with the students, hog Amanda while the women stay out of the way."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:102
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_31b4962b:

    # "Decides mantenerte a distancia del grupo de chicas. Sabes que, si te acercas a ellas, vas a ser objeto de bromas y hoy el centro de atención tiene que ser Amanda."
    "You decide to keep your distance from the group of girls. You know that, if you go near them, you're going to be the butt of their jokes, and today the center of attention must be Amanda."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:104
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e43fd160:

    # bet "Parece increíble, ¿no? Esta mañana teníamos a una versión de [emm] que se parecía a [dap] y ahora una versión de [eri] con la cara de [emm]."
    bet "Looks amazing, doesn't it? This morning, we had a version of [emm] that looked like [dap] and now a version of [eri] with [emm]'s face."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:105
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_34e0814c:

    # mc "Son más complejas que todo eso, Tía Betty. Aparte del obvio parecido físico, en cuanto a personalidad no puedes buscar una correlación total."
    mc "They're more complex than that, Aunt Betty. Aside from the obvious physical resemblance, personality-wise you can't look for a total correlation."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:106
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4ebc751c:

    # mc "Es cierto que Eva se parece mucho a [emm], pero hay muchos matices. También tiene mucho de ti, como el sentido del humor."
    mc "It's true that Eva behaves a lot like [emm], but there are a lot of nuances. She also has a lot of you, like your sense of humor."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:107
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d65da405:

    # mc "Y Amanda, pese a que es emocional como [eri], también es inteligente como [dap] o Scarlett."
    mc "And Amanda, despite being emotional like [eri], is also smart like [dap] or Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:109
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a6222657:

    # bet "Tienes razón. La mente juega malas pasadas y, sabiendo que son clones, busca más parecidos de los obvios."
    bet "You're right. The mind plays tricks and, knowing they are clones, looks for more resemblances than the most obvious."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:110
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_be2b6864:

    # mc "Sí, a mí también me pasa. Espero que Eva actúe como [emm]. La mayoría de las veces lo hace, pero a veces me sorprende."
    mc "Yes, it happens to me too. I expect Eva to act like [emm]. Most of the time she does, but sometimes she surprises me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:111
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8127a81d:

    # mc "Hoy en la clase de tiro podría haber avergonzado a Meemaw con lo estricta que era al principio."
    mc "Today, during the shooting class, she could have embarrassed Meemaw with how strict she was at first."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:113
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0789b0fa:

    # bet "Hablando de Olivia, ¿cómo ha ido la visita al médico?"
    bet "Speaking of Olivia, how did the visit to the doctor go?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:115
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3504c7ce:

    # bet "Ha vuelto más contenta de lo que esperaba sabiendo que no va a poder empezar el tratamiento todavía."
    bet "She came back happier than I expected, knowing that she's not going to be able to start her treatment yet."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:116
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bec6fc3a:

    # mc "Bueno, estaba un poco decepcionada sobre lo de no poder empezar el tratamiento inmediatamente, pero después se le ha pasado un poco."
    mc "Well, she was a little disappointed about not being able to start the treatment right away, but then she got over it a little bit."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:118
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8ac98141:

    # bet "Me ha dicho que me tienes que enseñar algo sobre los masajes, que yo no los estaba haciendo bien."
    bet "She told me that you have to teach me something about the massages. Wasn't I doing them right?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:119
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8e2ea9e9:

    # mc "Es lo que ha dicho la Dra. Milk. Hay una zona que no estás masajeando correctamente."
    mc "It's what Dr. Milk said. There's an area that you were not massaging correctly."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:121
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c1966eb3:

    # bet "Mañana, cuando toque darle el masaje, puedes enseñarme, si te va bien."
    bet "Tomorrow, when it's time to massage her, you can teach me, if that's okay with you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:122
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5ac7d1fb:

    # mc "Perfecto. No es difícil."
    mc "Perfect. It's not difficult."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:124
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ea3052e4:

    # mc "Aunque puede acabar siendo un poco pegajoso. *Risita*"
    mc "It may end up being a little sticky, though. *Chuckle*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:126
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_cc5707b4:

    # bet "¿Pegajoso? ¿Por qué? ¿La médico no le sacó la leche antes de los masajes?"
    bet "Sticky? Why? Didn't the doctor pump the milk before the massages?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:127
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d882d1bc:

    # mc "Sí, pero... por lo que dijo, es posible que no lo sacara todo."
    mc "Yes, but... from what she said, it's possible she didn't get it all out."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:128
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_417c029b:

    # bet "Mmmmm... Okaaay."
    bet "Mmmmm... Okaaay."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:130
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_42315518:

    # mee "¿Qué estáis planeando vosotros dos? *Risita*"
    mee "What are you two planning? *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:131
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6b64de23:

    # mc "Nada especial, Meemaw. Tía Betty me estaba pidiendo que le enseñara mañana lo que hemos hecho hoy."
    mc "Nothing special, Meemaw. Aunt Betty was just asking me to show her tomorrow what we did today at the doctor's."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:132
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7475059d:

    # mc "Podemos repetir lo de esta mañana si quieres."
    mc "We can repeat what we did this morning, if you want."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:135
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_813a9c52:

    # mee "¿Qué? {b}¿Todo?{/b}"
    mee "What? {b}Everything?{/b}"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:136
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1711c5b0:

    # mc "Lo que tú quieras, Meemaw."
    mc "Whatever you want, Meemaw."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:138
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ac9197b6:

    # bet "Mmmmm... ¿A qué te refieres con \"todo\", Olivia?"
    bet "Mmmmm... What do you mean by \"everything\", Olivia?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:139
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_44f8d873:

    # mc "La doctora nos ha enseñado dos formas de hacer el masaje. Una por delante, como lo haces tú, y otra desde atrás."
    mc "The doctor taught us two ways to do the massage. One from the front, like you do it, and one from behind."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:140
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c5c8eac6:

    # mc "Ha sido más cómodo hacerlo desde atrás, y con mejor resultado."
    mc "It was more comfortable to do it from behind, and with a better result."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:142
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e10117ec:

    # mee "¡[mc]!"
    mee "[mc]!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:143
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_09abbe64:

    # mc "¿Qué? Es cierto..."
    mc "What? It's true..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:145
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bf1923c1:

    # bet "Mmmm... ¿Ha pasado algo?"
    bet "Mmmm... Did something happen?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:146
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8bba0c69:

    # mc "¿Qué quieres que pase? Estábamos en la consulta del médico. *Risa*"
    mc "What do you want to happen? We were at the doctor's office. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:149
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2bd921d6:

    # bet "No sé... parece que dejarte a solas con una mujer de la familia tiene cierto riesgo..."
    bet "I don't know... it looks like leaving you alone with a female family member has a certain risk..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:161
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6f1d1f29:

    # bet "No sé... parece que dejarte a solas con una mujer tiene cierto riesgo... parece que las colecciones."
    bet "I don't know... it looks like leaving you alone with a woman has a certain risk... it looks like you collect them."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:164
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_60a36d9b:

    # mee "¡Betty! ¡Retira eso ahora mismo!"
    mee "Betty! Take that back right now!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:165
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a378340a:

    # mc "No te alteres, Meemaw. Betty está bromeando. Todos sabemos que no soy tu tipo. *Risa*"
    mc "Don't get upset, Meemaw. Betty's just kidding. We all know I'm not your type. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:167
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_dfaf7752:

    # mee "Tienes razón... últimamente estoy muy alterada y no sé por qué..."
    mee "You're right... I've been very agitated lately and I don't know why..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:171
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a07f1af3:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Siguiendo con el tema de los masajes. ¿Mañana por la mañana?"
    mc "Don't worry. Continuing with the massage topic. Tomorrow morning?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:174
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f588bc52:

    # mee "Sí, así le enseñas a Betty cómo se hace."
    mee "Yes, so you can teach Betty how it should be done."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:176
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_473dd280:

    # bet "Genial. ¿A las 10 en tu habitación?"
    bet "Great. 10 o'clock in your room?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:178
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2b095f8e:

    # mee "OK, a las 10, pero mejor en el baño, después de que me haya extraído la leche."
    mee "OK, at 10, but better in the bathroom, after I've pumped my milk out."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:179
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_05b6d64a:

    # mc "Genial entonces. Nos vemos a las 10 allí. Voy a hablar con [mar.mc!t] y [nor] un momento. Hasta ahora."
    mc "Great then. I'll see you at 10 there. I'm going to talk to [mar.mc!t] and [nor] for a moment. See you later."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:181
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bddafa05:

    # mc "Me sorprendéis."
    mc "I am surprised at you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:182
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8c28fd88:

    # mom "¿Qué hemos hecho?" (multiple=2)
    mom "What did we do?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:183
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9a72cb8a:

    # nor "¿Por qué?" (multiple=2)
    nor "Why?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:184
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_55d35f10:

    # mc "En la comida, con Eva, y ahora, con Amanda. Cuando pusisteis la condición de que vinieran a comer y a cenar, creía que no os ibais a separar de ellas."
    mc "At lunch, with Eva, and now, with Amanda. When you made it a condition that they come for lunch and dinner, I thought you weren't going to leave their side."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:186
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_933596db:

    # nor "Sabíamos que hoy no íbamos a poder tenerlas para nosotras. Son algo nuevo para todas, pero nosotras estuvimos con ellas ayer un rato."
    nor "We knew we weren't going to be able to have them for ourselves today. They're the novelty for everyone, and we were with them for a while yesterday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:187
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f2f616b7:

    # mom "Un rato muy corto. Pero las chicas también tienen derecho a estar con ellas y conocerlas. Incluso más que nosotras."
    mom "A very short while. But the girls also have the right to be with them and get to know them. Even more than us."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:188
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b84313df:

    # nor "Y también es bueno que las estudiantes las conozcan. Les hemos puesto un peso encima muy grande con el secreto, aunque todas han reaccionado bien."
    nor "And it's also good for the students to meet them. We've put a lot of weight on them with the secret, although they've all reacted well."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:190
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e1359237:

    # mc "Debbie también ha reaccionado bien pero, claro, tenía a Eva delante. No podía negar lo que estaba viendo."
    mc "Debbie also reacted well but, of course, she had Eva in front of her. She couldn't deny what she was seeing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:191
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_24679f30:

    # mc "Son buenas chicas, y se están integrando muy rápidamente en la familia. Sólo llevan una semana aquí."
    mc "They are good girls, and they are integrating very quickly into the family. They've only been here for a week."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:193
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4ad2c4cf:

    # mc "Y, cambiando de tema, supongo que ya habéis hablado de lo de esta tarde, ¿no?"
    mc "And, changing the topic, I assume you've already talked about this afternoon, haven't you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:196
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b481586a:

    # mom "¡Sí! Estamos las dos muy ilusionadas. Tenemos muchas ganas de contárselo a todo el mundo."
    mom "Yes! We are both very excited. We're really looking forward to telling everyone."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:197
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9b1fd37b:

    # nor "Hemos decidido hacerlo la semana que viene, una vez pasen los cumpleaños. El martes o el miércoles... o incluso más adelante."
    nor "We've decided to do it next week, once the birthdays are behind us. Tuesday or Wednesday... or even later."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:199
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_feb0eb3c:

    # nor "Tu madre tiene más ganas de hacerlo que yo. No sé cómo se lo tomará tu abuela."
    nor "Your mother is more eager to do it than I am. I don't know how your grandmother will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:201
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b3b46d99:

    # nor "[mar] tiene más ganas de hacerlo que yo. No sé cómo se lo tomará mi madre."
    nor "[mar] is more eager to do it than I am. I don't know how my mother will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:205
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_eb2e7751:

    # mom "Sí, nos hubiera gustado quedarnos las dos embarazadas a la vez, pero no ha podido ser. Ahora tan solo lo tenéis que intentar más."
    mom "Yes, we would have liked to both become pregnant at the same time, but it was not possible. Now you just have to try harder."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:206
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0ad5aad0:

    # nor "Hemos pensado que no deberíais contar nada hasta la semana que viene, una vez pasen los cumpleaños. El martes o el miércoles... o incluso más adelante."
    nor "We thought you shouldn't say anything until next week, after the birthdays are behind us. Tuesday or Wednesday... or even later."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:209
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_aa4df99e:

    # nor "¡Sí! Ya me lo ha dicho. ¡Felicidades, Papá!"
    nor "Yes! She already told me. Congratulations, Dad!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:210
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9e71bfb4:

    # mom "Se lo tenía que contar a alguien, y las chicas están descartadas este fin de semana. Es su fin de semana..."
    mom "I had to tell someone; and the girls are ruled out this weekend. It's their weekend..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:211
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8b6ab024:

    # mom "He pensado que no deberíamos contarles nada hasta la semana que viene, una vez pasen los cumpleaños. El martes o el miércoles."
    mom "I thought we shouldn't say anything until next week, after the birthdays are behind us. Tuesday or Wednesday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:213
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b89ebe5b:

    # nor "Tu madre tiene más ganas de hacerlo de las que tendría yo. No sé cómo se lo tomará tu abuela."
    nor "Your mother is more eager to do it than I would be. I don't know how your grandmother will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:215
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_22445e30:

    # nor "[mar] tiene más ganas de hacerlo de las que tendría yo. No sé cómo se lo tomará mi madre."
    nor "[mar] is more eager to do it than I would be. I don't know how my mother will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:219
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a5427c31:

    # nor "Sí, nos hubiera gustado quedarnos las dos embarazadas a la vez, pero no ha podido ser. Ahora tan solo lo tenéis que intentar más."
    nor "Yes, we would have liked to have both become pregnant at the same time, but it was not possible. Now you just have to try harder."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:220
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0441d811:

    # mom "Hemos pensado que no deberíais contar nada hasta la semana que viene, una vez pasen los cumpleaños. El martes o el miércoles..."
    mom "We thought you shouldn't say anything until next week, after the birthdays are behind us. Tuesday or Wednesday..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:223
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7c7fa9f3:

    # mom "¡Sí! Ya me lo ha dicho. ¡Felicidades, Papá!"
    mom "Yes! She already told me. Congratulations, Dad!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:224
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c8fb9871:

    # nor "Se lo tenía que contar a alguien, y las chicas están descartadas este fin de semana. Es su fin de semana..."
    nor "I needed to tell someone, and the girls are ruled out this weekend. It's their weekend..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:225
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_33649dd9:

    # nor "He pensado que no deberíamos contarles nada hasta la semana que viene, una vez pasen los cumpleaños. El martes o el miércoles."
    nor "I thought we shouldn't tell them anything until next week, after the birthdays are behind us. Tuesday or Wednesday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:227
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_16216de1:

    # mom "[nor] tiene menos ganas de hacerlo de las que tendría yo. No sabe cómo se lo tomará tu abuela."
    mom "[nor] is less eager to do it than I would be. She doesn't know how your grandmother will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:229
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_14d7eefb:

    # mom "[nor] tiene menos ganas de hacerlo de las que tendría yo. No sabe cómo se lo Olivia."
    mom "[nor] is less eager to do it than I would be. She doesn't know how Olivia will react."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:233
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d3e8fbfe:

    # mom "Ha sido decepcionante para las dos, igual que para ti, pero mientras estemos los tres unidos en esto..."
    mom "It's been disappointing for both of us, as it has been for you, but as long as the three of us are in this together..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:234
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bbf821af:

    # nor "Ha sido bonito poder apoyarnos la una en la otra... Al menos no mataremos a tu abuela con la noticia."
    nor "It's been nice to be able to rely on each other... At least we won't kill your grandmother with the news."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:237
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_be47cc7b:

    # mom "Necesitaba contárselo a alguien, tú te has ido a buscar a Amanda y... Sé que lo tenías que hacer, no estoy echándote nada en cara, pero necesitaba desahogarme."
    mom "I needed to tell someone; you've gone to pick Amanda up and... I know you had to, I'm not holding anything against you, but I needed to get it off my chest."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:239
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6e140e16:

    # nor "Para eso estamos las hermanas, ¿no? Al menos no mataréis a nuestra madre con la noticia este fin de semana."
    nor "That's what we sisters are for, right? At least you won't kill Mom with the news this weekend."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:241
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_eff5d031:

    # nor "Para eso estamos las amigas, ¿no? Al menos no mataréis a mi madre con la noticia este fin de semana."
    nor "That's what friends are for, right? At least you won't kill my mother with the news this weekend."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:244
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8157ca37:

    # nor "Necesitaba contárselo a alguien, tú te has ido a buscar a Amanda y... Sé que lo tenías que hacer, no estoy echándote nada en cara, pero necesitaba desahogarme."
    nor "I needed to tell someone; you've gone off to pick Amanda up and... I know you had to, I'm not holding anything against you, but I needed to get it off my chest."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:246
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_162af352:

    # mom "Para eso estamos las hermanas, ¿no? Al menos no mataréis a nuestra madre con la noticia este fin de semana."
    mom "That's what we sisters are for, right? At least you won't kill Mom with the news this weekend."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:248
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_58ccd7f7:

    # mom "Para eso estamos las amigas, ¿no? Al menos no mataréis a mi madre con la noticia este fin de semana."
    mom "That's what friends are for, right? At least you won't kill Olivia with the news this weekend."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:249
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8c5e0796:

    # mc "Le tenéis mucho miedo a las reacciones de Meemaw. Creo que si le dais un poco de confianza, os va a dar una sorpresa."
    mc "You are too afraid of Meemaw's reactions. I think that, if you give her a little trust, she will surprise you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:251
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_59a967bf:

    # nor "Bueno, ya hablaremos. No creo que sea el momento ni el lugar para hablar de esto. No te gires, pero Tía Betty lleva un rato mirando hacia aquí."
    nor "Well, we'll talk about it. I don't think this is the time or place to discuss this. Don't turn around, but Aunt Betty has been looking this way for a while."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:255
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7cd364ea:

    # nor "¿Que parte de \"no te gires\" no has entendido? *Risa*"
    nor "What part of \"don't turn around\" didn't you understand? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:256
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_25d6762a:

    # mc "Sabes que frases como \"no te gires\" o \"no mires\" no funcionan conmigo, ¿verdad? *Risa*"
    mc "You know that sentences like \"don't turn around\" or \"don't look\" don't work on me, don't you? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:258
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_36b07cb7:

    # mom "Lo peor de todo es que después te atreves a decir que somos nosotras las que somos unas cotillas. *Risa*"
    mom "The worst of it all is that you dare to say that we are the ones who are gossipy. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:259
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_524e8156:

    # mc "Y lo sois. *Risa* Voy a hacer un poco de vida social con las estudiantes antes de que Tía Betty siga sospechando."
    mc "Because you are. *Laugh* I'm going to do a bit of socializing with the students before Aunt Betty gets any more suspicious."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:261
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1e3d3493:

    # nor "Hablando de eso, creo que Debbie y Lisa están esperando para hablar contigo. Están mirando hacia aquí."
    nor "Speaking of that, I think Debbie and Lisa are waiting to talk to you. They've been looking this way for a while now."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:262
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4e4536bf:

    # mc "Pues voy a hablar con ellas, a ver que les han parecido Amanda y Eva. Hablamos luego."
    mc "Well, I'm going to talk to them, see what they think of Amanda and Eva. We'll talk later."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:264
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5fcfc908:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. ¿Qué os parece la reunión familiar?"
    mc " Hey, girls. What do you think of the family gathering?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:265
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_06bf8711:

    # deb "¡Alucinante! Después de 15 minutos hablando con Amanda, es como si la conociera de toda la vida. Y con Eva me he sentido igual a mediodía. Son muy simpáticas."
    deb " Mind-blowing! After 15 minutes of talking to Amanda, it's as if I've known her all my life. And I felt the same way with Eva at lunchtime. They are very nice."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:266
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_06143a3c:

    # lis "Yo me he perdido a Eva. Tengo ganas de conocerla mañana en la cena."
    lis "I missed Eva. I'm looking forward to meeting her tomorrow at dinner."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:268
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_950fa0ca:

    # deb "Eva es más musculosa que Amanda, o a Amanda se le nota menos con ese vestido. Al menos ya no soy la rara de la familia."
    deb "Eva is more muscular than Amanda, or Amanda's muscles are less noticeable in that dress. At least I'm not the family weirdo anymore."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:269
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_19cc60ff:

    # mc "Nunca has sido rara, Debbie. Un cuerpo musculoso puede ser bonito."
    mc "You've never been a weirdo, Debbie. A muscular body can be pretty."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:270
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8d37d857:

    # lis "¿Ves? Te lo he dicho siempre. No tienes que acomplejarte de tus músculos."
    lis "See what I mean? I tell you that all the time. You don't have to be self-conscious about your muscles."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:271
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_93a4d35c:

    # mcp "(Yo lo recuerdo de otra forma, al menos cuando fuimos a la tienda de Maddie...)"
    mcp "(I remember it differently, at least when we went to Maddie's store...)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:273
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1ff7550a:

    # lis "¿Te importa si salimos a tomar el aire un momento? Empieza a hacer calor aquí."
    lis "Do you mind if we go outside and get some fresh air for a moment? It's starting to get hot in here."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:274
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2b18189a:

    # mc "Si, claro."
    mc "Yes, of course."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:275
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_df75b013:

    # lis "Los tres..."
    lis "The three of us..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:276
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_890c041b:

    # mc "Por supuesto."
    mc "Of course."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:278
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bec319b3:

    # lis "Se agradece el frescor de la tarde. Creo que deberíais cambiar los focos halógenos por LED. Consumen menos y dan menos calor."
    lis "Evening coolness is appreciated. I think you should change the halogen spotlights to LEDs. They consume less and are less hot."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:279
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9dfaf62b:

    # deb "Lisa..."
    deb "Lisa..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:281
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_425d0097:

    # lis "¿Qué? ¡Es verdad! ¡Es un desperdicio de electricidad enorme! Y el planeta..."
    lis "What? It's true! It's a huge waste of energy! And the planet..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:282
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9fa1e387:

    # mc "Lisa, ¿pasa algo? Hacía días que no sacabas a relucir el tema del planeta o la contaminación... "
    mc "Lisa, is something wrong? It's been days since you brought up the subject of the planet or pollution... "

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:283
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f7e0faf5:

    # deb "Suele hacerlo cuando está nerviosa..."
    deb "She tends to do it when she is nervous..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:284
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_99640ec0:

    # lis "¡Debbie!"
    lis "Debbie!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:285
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2f870f32:

    # mc "¿Por qué estás nerviosa, Lisa?"
    mc "What are you nervous about, Lisa?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:287
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1c3155e1:

    # lis "Porque te iba a contar algo, pero me acabo de dar cuenta de que es una tontería que posiblemente ni te importe."
    lis "I was going to tell you something, but I just realized it's silly and you probably don't even care."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:300
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bf3caaa0:

    # lis "Anthony y yo... tal como te dije... no me veía con alguien como él... No sentía nada cuando estaba con él."
    lis "Anthony and I... just like I told you... I didn't see myself with someone like him... I didn't feel anything when I was with him."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:301
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e151f395:

    # lis "Ayer estuvimos hablando y... a él le pasa lo mismo... hemos decidido romper nuestra \"no relación\"."
    lis " We were talking yesterday and... he feels the same... we've decided to break our \"no relationship\"."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:303
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8050236d:

    # lis "Creo que ninguno de los dos quería hablar de ello para no hacerle daño al otro... pero los dos queríamos dejar de hacer lo que estábamos haciendo."
    lis "I don't think either of us wanted to talk about it so as not to hurt the other... but we both wanted to stop doing what we were doing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:304
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_adcf19fa:

    # lis "Hemos decidido seguir siendo amigos, pero no vamos a intentar ser algo más."
    lis "We've decided to remain friends, but we're not going to try to be something more."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:305
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a6572655:

    # mc "¿Te das cuenta como sí era importante? Nunca dudes en contarme algo que te preocupe, Lisa."
    mc "Do you realize that it was indeed an important thing to tell me? Never hesitate to tell me about anything that's bothering you, Lisa."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:308
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_761952b8:

    # lis "De todas formas... a los dos... nos gustan otras personas, con lo que creo que es lo mejor, de todas formas."
    lis "Anyway... we both... like other people, so I think it's for the best, anyway."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:309
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3c46c38b:

    # mc "¿Alguien que has conocido desde que has llegado?"
    mc "Someone you've met since you've arrived?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:310
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_424a2793:

    # lis "Sí..."
    lis "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:311
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c6f9a0e0:

    # mc "¡Eso es fantástico, Lisa! ¡Nos lo tienes que presentar!"
    mc "That's fantastic, Lisa! You have to introduce us to him!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:313
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ab24fcb8:

    # lis "Sí, un día te diré quién es..."
    lis "Yes, I will tell you one day who he is..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:314
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c4ea5ac7:

    # deb "Sobre eso..."
    deb "About that..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:317
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b6ff0358:

    # lis "De todas formas... a él... le gusta otra persona, con lo que creo que es lo mejor, de todas formas."
    lis "Anyway... he... likes someone else, so I think it's for the best, anyway."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:320
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c4ea5ac7_1:

    # deb "Sobre eso..."
    deb "About that..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:322
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1a01d9d4:

    # deb "Ahora que estamos aquí los tres... podríamos... ya sabes..."
    deb "Now that the three of us are here... can we... you know..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:323
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0afb7e3a:

    # mc "Si quieres, sí. Es tu decisión a quién y cuándo decírselo."
    mc "If you want to, yes. It's your call to whom and when to tell."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:325
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4f85dc05:

    # deb "Lisa, tengo... tenemos algo que contarte..."
    deb "Lisa, I have... we have something to tell you..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:326
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7bb6c65d:

    # deb "[mc] y yo estamos... más o menos... saliendo juntos..."
    deb "[mc] and I are... sort of... dating..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:328
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_680cc806:

    # lis "¿Qué? ¿Desde cuándo? ¿Qué es eso de más o menos?"
    lis "What? Since when? What's about that \"sort of\"?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:329
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7b8b768a:

    # mc "Aún no hemos hablado de como llamarlo, pero podríamos decir que esta mañana hemos decidido empezar algo y ver a donde nos lleva."
    mc "We haven't talked about what to label it yet, but we could say that this morning we decided to start something and see where it takes us."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:331
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5bf69428:

    # lis "¡Es fantástico, Debbie! Nunca hubiera pensado que tendrías novio antes que yo, pero... ¡me alegro muchísimo!"
    lis "That's great, Debbie! I never would have thought you'd have a boyfriend before me, but... I'm so happy for you!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:332
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_306d345f:

    # deb "Gracias, Lisa... no ha empezado como me había imaginado, pero el resultado ha sido mejor aún."
    deb "Thank you, Lisa... it didn't start out the way I had imagined, but the result was even better."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:333
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_705d0f7a:

    # mc "Te debo una cita de verdad. *Risa*"
    mc "I owe you a real date. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:335
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c697845d:

    # lis "Y tú... más vale que la cuides y no le hagas daño o te las tendrás que ver conmigo."
    lis "And you... you'd better take care of her and not hurt her, or you'll have to deal with me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:336
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0b5289d3:

    # mc "No tengo intención de hacerle daño, Lisa. No soy así."
    mc "I have no intention of hurting her, Lisa. I'm not like that."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:338
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_332f72ad:

    # lis "Me lo tenéis que contar todo. Lo estáis rodeando de misterio."
    lis "You have to tell me everything. You are shrouding it in mystery."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:339
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a647d546:

    # mc "No sé si aquí y ahora es el mejor momento para hacerlo."
    mc "I don't know if here and now is the best time to do it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:340
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1e767339:

    # deb "Creo que no, pero deberíamos volver con Amanda, estar un ratito... y, si quieres, volvemos pronto a la habitación y te lo cuento todo... si a [mc] no le importa."
    deb "I don't think so, but we should go back to Amanda, hang out for a little while... and, if you want, we'll go back to our room soon and I'll tell you all about it... if [mc] doesn't mind."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:341
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1b330c2e:

    # mc "Adelante, Debbie. Creo que es una conversación entre hermanas en la que no debo estar. Además, yo voy a tenerlo más complicado para desaparecer."
    mc "Go ahead, Debbie. I think this is a sisterly conversation I'm not supposed to be in. Besides, I'm going to have a harder time disappearing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:342
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ba0f8eb1:

    # mc "Tengo que llevar de nuevo a Amanda a su base cuando acabe la cena."
    mc "I have to take Amanda back to her base when dinner is over."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:344
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_79214577:

    # lis "Genial, volvamos dentro. Tengo ganas de que me lo expliques todo."
    lis "Great, let's go back inside. I'm looking forward to you explaining it all to me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:345
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_71c1f7d2:

    # deb "Deberás tener un poco de paciencia. No nos vamos a ir inmediatamente."
    deb "You need to have a little patience. We're not going to leave immediately."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:346
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9c641d1e:

    # lis "Pero cuánto antes volvamos, antes nos podremos ir a nuestra habitación, ¿no?"
    lis "But the sooner we get back, the sooner we can go to our room, right?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:347
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_44d08f66:

    # deb "Vaaale, vamos."
    deb "Okaaay, let's go."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:349
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_77b0ad79:

    # deb "Hasta luego, [mc]. Te buscaré para mi beso de buenas noches antes de irnos."
    deb "See you later, [mc]. I'll look for you for my goodnight kiss before we go."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:350
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3a65cc3e:

    # mc "Lo estaré esperando."
    mc "I'll be looking forward to it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:352
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_007d0f29:

    # lis "Yo también vendré a buscar el mío... si Debbie me deja hacerlo, claro."
    lis "I'll come get mine too... if Debbie will let me do it, of course."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:353
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c2caae19:

    # deb "No hay ningún problema en que te bese, ¿verdad?"
    deb "There's no problem with her kissing you, is there?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:354
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_91c9ce2b:

    # mc "No, Debbie. Que tú y yo hayamos empezado algo, no significa que tengamos que eliminar las buenas costumbres."
    mc "No, Debbie. Just because you and I have started something, doesn't mean we have to do away with good habits."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:357
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e1992981:

    # deb "[emm] tenía razón, te cuesta pillar algunas cosas. *Risita*"
    deb "[emm] was right, you have a hard time catching some things. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:358
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2dba3c8c:

    # deb "Lisa, deberíamos entrar y seguir charlando con Amanda un rato. Hoy quiero acostarme pronto."
    deb "Lisa, we should go inside and continue chatting with Amanda for a while. I want to turn in early today."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:360
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1f1f5279:

    # deb "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    deb "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:361
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_322b093a:

    # lis "Nos vemos dentro."
    lis "See you inside."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:362
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_eb026555:

    # mc "Hasta ahora, chicas."
    mc "Hasta la vista, babies."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:370
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5b9cba8d:

    # "Al volver a la cocina ves como Amanda te hace señas para que vayas a una zona sin gente."
    "As you return to the kitchen you notice Amanda beckoning you to an uncrowded area."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:371
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_792c3b3e:

    # mc "¿Qué tal te lo estás pasando?"
    mc "Are you having a good time?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:372
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c78f6326:

    # ama "¡Ufff! Es mejor de lo que me había dicho Eva. Es como sentirse parte de algo."
    ama "Whew! It's better than what Eva told me. It's like feeling part of something."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:373
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a1731fc8:

    # mc "Y sólo es el primer día que vienes. Espera a que vayan cogiendo confianza."
    mc "And it's only the first day you are here. Wait until they build up some familiarity."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:375
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e7d6eaab:

    # ama "Eva ya me había advertido. Hay un componente de sentirse un animal exhibido. Todo el mundo quiere saber cosas de nosotras."
    ama "Eva already warned me. There is a component of feeling like an animal on display. Everyone wants to know things about us."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:376
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0cd3e20a:

    # ama "Pero supongo que en un par de días se les pasará. Pese a todo es un momento increíble."
    ama "But I guess in a couple of days they'll get over it. All in all, it's an amazing moment."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:377
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_76951022:

    # mc "Olvídalo. Siempre querremos saber más cosas de vosotras."
    mc "Forget about it. We'll always want to know more about you two."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:378
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b822f1af:

    # mc "Por cierto, saluda a Eva. Supongo que nos está oyendo por el auricular."
    mc "By the way, say hello to Eva. I guess she's hearing us through the earset."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:380
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9fbd07d6:

    # ama "No... si nos está oyendo, será a través de los micrófonos de la cocina, pero no llevo auricular hoy."
    ama "No... if she's hearing us, it would be through the kitchen microphones, but I'm not wearing an earpiece today."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:381
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b3961c59:

    # mc "¿Por qué?"
    mc "Why?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:383
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8cfdf610:

    # ama "Quería... quería que esta experiencia fuera solo mía."
    ama "I wanted... I wanted this experience to be mine alone."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:384
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_14aeb48f:

    # ama "Sé que puede sonar ridículo, pero Eva y yo hemos vivido toda nuestra vida juntas. Todas nuestras experiencias han sido compartidas."
    ama "I know it may sound ridiculous, but Eva and I have lived our entire lives together. All of our experiences have been shared."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:385
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_63276cde:

    # ama "La quiero con locura, no me malinterpretes, pero a veces librarse de tu hermana siamesa... es bueno. Raro, pero bueno."
    ama "I love her madly, don't get me wrong, but sometimes getting rid of your Siamese sister... is good. Weird, but good."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:386
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b5e78b15:

    # mc "¿Todas vuestras experiencias?"
    mc "All of your experiences?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:388
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b73b3ebe:

    # ama "¡[mc]! Hay cosas que no se le preguntan a una dama. *Risa*"
    ama "[mc]! There are things you don't ask a lady. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:389
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b5c30716:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¡No! No me refería a eso... sea lo que sea a lo que te refieras tú."
    mc "What? No! That's not what I meant... whatever you think I meant."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:391
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6cc01880:

    # ama "No te preocupes. *Risita* Hoy me han preguntado cosas muy raras, y no me hubiera sorprendido si alguna de ellas me hubiera preguntado si Eva y yo éramos pareja."
    ama "Don't worry about it. *Giggle* I've been asked some really weird questions today, and I wouldn't have been surprised if one of them had asked me if Eva and I were a couple."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:392
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a3db9a7f:

    # mc "¿Qué?"
    mc "What?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:394
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d46a3163:

    # ama "¿Qué? ¡No! ¡No me refería a que lo fuéramos! ¡No lo somos! ¡A mí me gustan los hombres! Y ya sabes que a Eva también."
    ama "What? No! I didn't mean we are! We're not! I like men! And you know Eva does too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:395
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5c22c4b3:

    # mc "*Risa* Sí, lo sé. Lo de esta mañana ha sido un poco alucinante. \"Me caías mal, pero estás bueno y te iba a echar un polvo aunque eso jodiera tu relación con [eri]\"."
    mc "*Laugh* Yes, I know. This morning was a little mind-blowing. \"I didn't like you, but you were hot and I was going to fuck you even if it screwed up your relationship with [eri]\"."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:397
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f7a2d5c7:

    # ama "Mi hermana puede ser tan impulsiva como la tuya. Y puede pensar lo mismo en las consecuencias de sus actos. Es decir, nada."
    ama "My sister can be as impulsive as yours. And she can think the same about the consequences of her actions. Meaning, nothing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:398
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e40f181d:

    # mc "Lo estoy descubriendo... hablando de la Princesa Rosa..."
    mc "I'm discovering it... And speaking of the Pink Princess..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:400
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e9557bbb:

    # emm "¿Hablabais de mí? He oído la palabra \"hermana\"... Y estando aquí mis dos hermanos, sólo podía ser yo."
    emm "Were you talking about me? I heard the word \"sister\"... And with my two siblings here, it could only be me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:401
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f4b864c5:

    # mcp "(Dos hermanos... me encanta cómo en un par de horas todo el mundo considera a Amanda familia. Lo mismo que ha pasado con Eva.)"
    mcp "(Two siblings... I love how, in a couple of hours, everyone considers Amanda family. Same thing that happened with Eva.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:402
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2f56586e:

    # mc "Sí, hablábamos de lo mucho que os parecéis..."
    mc "Yes, we were just talking about how much alike..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:404
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3a19ad23:

    # emm "Es normal, ¿no? Al fin y al cabo llevamos los mismos genes."
    emm "It's normal, isn't it? We carry the same genes after all."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:405
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_cb95c762:

    # ama "... de lo mucho que os parecéis Eva y tú."
    ama "... about how much alike you and Eva are."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:407
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_70e95e06:

    # emm "¡Es verdad! ¡Le he dicho a [mc] que Eva me recordaba a alguien! ¡A mí!"
    emm "It's true! I told [mc] that Eva reminded me of someone! Of me!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:409
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8234382e:

    # emm "También le he dicho que es fantástica... lo cual me convierte a mí también en fantástica, ¿no?"
    emm "I've also told him she's awesome... Which makes me awesome too, doesn't it?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:410
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_53383284:

    # mc "Sí, [emm], eres fantástica. *Risa*"
    mc "Yes, [emm], you're awesome. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:412
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_23d0b31b:

    # emm "¡Y el resto de las chicas también lo han dicho! No sólo fantástica, pero otras cosas bonitas también. ¡Eso significa que también piensan lo mismo de mí!"
    emm "And the rest of the girls have said so too! Not only awesome, but other nice things too. That means they think the same about me too!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:413
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_74f00f8f:

    # mc "*Risa* Bueno... quizás..."
    mc "*Laugh* Well... perhaps..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:414
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_34a1f259:

    # ama "Sí, estoy segura de que piensan eso de ti."
    ama "Yes, I'm sure they think that about you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:416
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_86ec97d1:

    # emm "¡Claro! ¡Tú has oído todas nuestras conversaciones! Me tienes que contar todo lo que han dicho de mí."
    emm "Of course! You've heard all our conversations! You have to tell me everything they've said about me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:417
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c95ab1c9:

    # ama "Pero eso significaría que también les debería contar al resto lo que han dicho de ellas. Sería lo justo, ¿no?"
    ama "But that would mean I should also tell the rest of them what you said about them. That would be the fair thing to do, wouldn't it?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:419
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0ec6e7c6:

    # emm "Mmmm... entonces mejor no... Esta mañana he dicho cosas muy feas de mi madre..."
    emm "Mmmm... then you'd better not... This morning, I said some very nasty things about my mother..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:421
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2abc6e1b:

    # emm "Pero bueno, os dejo un rato. ¡Voy a decirle a las chicas que me han estado alabando cuando alababan a Eva!"
    emm "But well, I'll leave you for a while. I'm going to tell the girls that they have been praising me when they were praising Eva!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:422
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_99af6d99:

    # mc "¡[emm]!"
    mc "[emm]!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:424
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6baffd85:

    # mc "Y se fue..."
    mc "And she's gone..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:425
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_186af1e4:

    # ama "Exactamente lo mismo que hubiera hecho Eva. *Risa*"
    ama "Exactly the same thing Eva would have done. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:427
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3b5f6a00:

    # ama "Creo que voy a volver un rato con las chicas si no te importa. Quiero escuchar lo que dice [emm]."
    ama "I think I'm going to go back for a while with the girls if you don't mind. I want to hear what [emm] tells them."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:428
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9b41bdc5:

    # mc "Ningún problema, pero sabes perfectamente lo que va a decir. Imagínate lo que diría Eva. *Risa*"
    mc "No problem, but you know exactly what she's going to say. Imagine what Eva would say. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:430
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4f645ed5:

    # ama "Sí pero no. Eva y [emm] son muy parecidas en la superficie, pero tienen más matices de los que parece."
    ama "Yes but no. Eva and [emm] are very similar on the surface, but they are more nuanced than they seem."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:431
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_18f2290b:

    # mc "¿Igual que tú con [dap] y [eri]? También con matices, claro."
    mc "Same as you with [dap] and [eri]? Also with nuances, of course."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:433
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_37425cf3:

    # ama "¿A qué te refieres? ¿Crees que me parezco a [dap] y a [eri]?"
    ama "What do you mean? Do you think I resemble [dap] and [eri]?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:434
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_21061f91:

    # mc "Eres inteligente como [dap], pero emocional como [eri]. Sólo había que mirarte durante la reunión con Aaron."
    mc "You're smart like [dap], but emotional like [eri]. One only had to look at you during the meeting with Aaron."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:435
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_99117642:

    # mc "Pasabas de la pose hiper-profesional, que sería [dap], a fundirte cuando [mar] te cogía de la mano o cuando [nor] te abrazaba, que sería [eri]."
    mc "You went from the hyper-professional pose, which would be [dap], to melting when [mar] held your hand or when [nor] hugged you, which would be [eri]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:437
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e307cb3f:

    # ama "No puedes imaginarte lo emocionante que fue para nosotras. Desde que Aaron nos dijo que teníamos que conoceros..."
    ama "You can't imagine how exciting it was for us. Ever since Aaron told us we had to meet you..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:438
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_584d6eed:

    # ama "Eva y yo habíamos hablado durante horas sobre cómo podía ser esa única reunión. Os íbamos a conocer y no volver a veros..."
    ama "Eva and I talked for hours about how that one meeting could be. We were going to meet you and never see you again..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:439
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3c1fb1b3:

    # mc "Y ahora estás aquí."
    mc "And now you are here."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:441
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1c084293:

    # ama "Y tampoco puedes imaginarte lo que llevo dos horas sintiendo. O lo que Eva ha sentido esta mañana."
    ama "And you can't imagine what I've been feeling for the last two hours either. Or what Eva felt this morning."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:442
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_bf58f654:

    # mc "No, desde luego que no puedo, pero me alegro de que lo estéis sintiendo. Tú tampoco te puedes imaginar lo que significa para mí la recepción que os ha dado la familia."
    mc "No, I certainly can't, but I'm glad you're feeling it. You can't imagine what the reception the family has given you means to me either."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:443
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_441c7a93:

    # mc "Sabía cómo se iban a comportar, pero verlo... ¡Ufff! Son cosas como esta las que me hacen estar orgulloso de pertenecer a esta familia."
    mc "I knew how they were going to behave, but to see it... Wow! It's things like this that make me proud to belong to this family."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:445
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_fc061e61:

    # ama "Tienes razones para estarlo. Tienes una familia fantástica y estoy deseando conocer al resto de la familia."
    ama "You have every reason to be. You have a fantastic family, and I can't wait to meet the rest."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:446
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ca643416:

    # mc "¿El resto?"
    mc "The rest?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:447
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b93ad310:

    # ama "Samantha, Simone, Jamaal... y no sé si me dejo a alguien más. Supongo que sí."
    ama "Samantha, Simone, Jamaal... and I don't know if I'm leaving anyone else out. I guess I am."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:448
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8f38794e:

    # mc "Espera un momento... Consideras a Samantha, a Simone y a Jamaal parte de la familia, ¿no?"
    mc "Wait a minute... You consider Samantha, Simone, and Jamaal part of the family, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:450
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c8f9153c:

    # ama "Sí, claro. Cuando habláis de ellos, especialmente [mar], [nor], las chicas, y tú, se nota que los consideráis familia."
    ama "Yes, of course. When you talk about them, especially [mar], [nor], the girls, and you, you can tell that you consider them family."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:451
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ea552a05:

    # mc "Entonces, si se trata de si nosotros consideramos a alguien familia o no..."
    mc "So, if it comes down to whether we consider someone family or not..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:456
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_91af78a8:

    # mc "¿Cómo crees que te consideran todas estas personas?"
    mc "How do you think all these people consider you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:458
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9713bec4:

    # mc "Chicas, un momento, por favor. ¿Hay alguna de vosotras que, después de todo lo que ha pasado hoy, considere que Eva y Amanda forman parte de la familia?"
    mc "Ladies, just a moment, please. Are there any of you who, after everything that has happened today, consider Eva and Amanda to be part of the family?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:460
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_821b0321:

    # mom "¡Claro que forman parte de la familia! Si ellas quieren, por supuesto."
    mom "Of course they are part of the family! If they want to, of course."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:461
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8502d515:

    # mcp "(Sabía que ibas a decir eso. Tú y [nor] sois las que primero las aceptasteis.)"
    mcp "(I knew you were going to say that. You and [nor] are the ones who accepted them first.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:463
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3fec7667:

    # nor "Sólo a ti se te podría ocurrir preguntar una tontería así."
    nor "Only you could think of asking such a silly question."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:464
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b334e3bf:

    # mcp "(Bueno, tampoco hay que matar al mensajero. *Risa mental*)"
    mcp "(Well, let's not kill the messenger either. *Mental Laughter*)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:466
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_22a6892d:

    # kat "Es difícil decir que no lo son cuando podrían pasar por hermanas de [dap], [eri], y [emm]."
    kat "It's hard to say they're not when they could pass for [dap], [eri], and [emm]'s sisters."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:467
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b3eee520:

    # mcp "(Te tengo que preguntar que versión te gusta más.)"
    mcp "(I have to ask you which version you like the most.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:469
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_574f0173:

    # bet "Son un regalo divino. ¿Cómo no van a ser parte de esta familia?"
    bet "They are a divine gift. How can they not be part of this family?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:470
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9482eec0:

    # mcp "(¿Divino? Ciencia, Tía Betty, ciencia.)"
    mcp "(Divine? Science, Aunt Betty, science.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:472
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a6050117:

    # deb "¿No sentís que desde la playa parecemos una familia? ¿Todas?"
    deb "Don't you feel that, since the beach party, we look like a family? All of us?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:473
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6a87537e:

    # mcp "(No eres la primera que lo piensa.)"
    mcp "(You're not the first one to think so.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:475
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_157f8834:

    # oma "Si me habéis aceptado a mí..."
    oma "If you accepted me..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:476
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_178d4e0b:

    # mcp "(¿Cómo no vamos a aceptarte? Debbie lo acaba de decir. Estabas en la playa.)"
    mcp "(How can we not accept you? Debbie just said so. You were at the beach.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:478
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_baee7f66:

    # kia "Y a nosotras..."
    kia "And us..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:479
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2b978df9:

    # mcp "(Aunque desde que estuvimos en tu casa te noto un poco distante. Debería hablar contigo.)"
    mcp "(Although since we were at your house, you seem a little distant. I should talk to you.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:481
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1631926f:

    # mee "Después de encontrar a mis nuevas nietas, no voy a dejar que nadie se atreva a arrebatármelas."
    mee "After finding my new granddaughters, I'm not going to let anyone dare to take them away from me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:482
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_a2be105c:

    # mcp "(¡Cómo has cambiado, Meemaw!)"
    mcp "(You have changed a lot, Meemaw!)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:484
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7fc4487b:

    # kim "Sólo llevo aquí una semana. Me siento más en familia de lo que me he sentido en ningún sitio desde que me fui de casa de mis padres."
    kim "I've only been here for a week. I feel more at home than I've felt anywhere since I left my parents' house. I guess that's what a family makes me feel."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:485
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6d9a67e6:

    # mcp "(Espera a llevar un mes, o un año.)"
    mcp "(Wait until you've been here for a month, or a year.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:487
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8664daea:

    # eil "Formar parte de esta familia es increíble, Amanda. No dejes que nadie te lo impida. Ni siquiera tú misma."
    eil "Being part of this family is wonderful, Amanda. Don't let anyone prevent you from it. Not even yourself."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:488
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_89efcb76:

    # mcp "(Siempre lo has deseado, ahora se ha hecho realidad.)"
    mcp "(You've always wanted it, now it's come true.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:490
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_d6c07a44:

    # dap "¿Cómo no van a formar parte? Somos ellas y ellas son nosotras."
    dap "How can they not be part of it? We are them and they are us."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:491
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_58dccfe3:

    # mcp "(No lo podías haber expresado mejor.)"
    mcp "(You couldn't have put it better.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:493
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5b0e6d46:

    # sai "[mc] me había hablado de su familia en Portland. No es difícil de entenderlo una vez lo vives, Amanda."
    sai "[mc] told me about his family while we were in Portland. It's not hard to understand once you live it, Amanda."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:494
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0d1231f4:

    # mcp "(Y ahora te das cuenta de que no mentía.)"
    mcp "(And now you realize I wasn't lying.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:496
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f28a0ced:

    # eri "Dejadnos ser vuestra familia, Amanda. Dejadnos demostraros que tenéis un lugar aquí, con nosotros. Sed nuestra familia también."
    eri "Let us be your family, Amanda. Let us show you that you have a place here, with us. Be our family too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:497
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_94023dc5:

    # mcp "(¿Dejadnos? Eres maravillosa, [eri].)"
    mcp "(Let us? You are wonderful, [eri].)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:499
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3ec34be7:

    # lis "Incluso las recién llegadas nos sentimos así. Si se lo permites... si nos lo permites, no tardarás en darte cuenta."
    lis "Even we newcomers feel that way. If you let them... if you let us, it won't be long before you figure it out."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:500
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_cd8045c8:

    # mcp "(¿Quién hubiera podido pensar hace sólo una semana que Lisa diría \"nos lo permites\"?)"
    mcp "(Who would have thought just a week ago that Lisa would say \"If you let us\"?)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:502
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_3af80b12:

    # sca "En parte gracias a ti tengo esta familia. Quiero que tú también formes parte de ella."
    sca "It is partly thanks to you that I have this family. I want you to be part of it too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:503
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6792b0e7:

    # mcp "(Tú ya formabas parte de la familia, cielo, pero aún no lo sabíamos.)"
    mcp "(You were already part of the family, sweetie, but we didn't know it yet.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:505
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_fa90e986:

    # emm "¿Cómo vamos a rechazar a la segunda mujer más guapa del mundo? *Risa*"
    emm "How are we going to turn down the second most beautiful woman in the world? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:506
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_86eeadeb:

    # mcp "([emm]...)"
    mcp "([emm]...)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:508
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b4d575fc:

    # emm "Sólo bromeaba. Compartimos cara y genes. Compartamos familia también."
    emm "Just kidding. We share the same face and genes. Let's share family too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:509
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_6986d2d1:

    # mcp "(¡Esa es mi hermanita!)"
    mcp "(That's my little sister!)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:511
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_17258974:

    # mc "¿Ves? ¿Te convences ahora?"
    mc "See? Are you convinced now?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:513
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4238debc:

    # ama "Yo... yo..."
    ama "I... I..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:514
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b7258b38:

    # ama "Necesito un momento..."
    ama "I need a moment..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:515
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1f5924d4:

    # mc "¡Espera Amanda!"
    mc "Amanda! Wait!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:517
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ac15c146:

    # mc "Voy a buscarla... ahora volvemos..."
    mc "I'm going to look for her... we'll be right back..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:519
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_064519f9:

    # mc "Amanda, ¿estás bien? ¿Qué pasa?"
    mc "Amanda, are you okay? What's wrong?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:520
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_abafa3cc:

    # ama "N-nada... sólo necesito un momento..."
    ama "N-nothing... I just need a moment..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:521
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_417e578c:

    # mc "Pero ¿estás bien?"
    mc "But, are you okay?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:523
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_cd7b6df4:

    # ama "¡Joder, [mc]! ¡Te he dicho que necesito un momento!"
    ama "Fuck, [mc]! I told you I need a moment!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:524
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_be7bf1b6:

    # mc "Vale. Estaré dentro si me necesitas. Estaré dondequiera que me necesites. Siempre."
    mc "Okay. I'll be inside if you need me. I'll be wherever you need me. Always."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:532
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_edabac82:

    # ama "*Sollozo* Lo siento, [mc]."
    ama "*Sob* I'm sorry, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:533
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_36f2127d:

    # mc "Shhhh... no hace falta, Amanda. Podemos ser un poco intensos."
    mc "Shhhh... no need, Amanda. We can be a tad intense."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:534
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0e2f1765:

    # ama "*Sollozo* Eva me había avisado..."
    ama "*Sob* Eva warned me..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:535
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_df124971:

    # mc "¿Tan malos somos?"
    mc "Are we really that bad?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:537
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_af07c27a:

    # ama "*Sollozo* No me refiero a eso... me había avisado de los ninjas cortadores de cebollas que tenéis en la cocina."
    ama "*Sob* That's not what I meant... She warned me about the onion-cutting ninjas you have hidden in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:538
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5ad4ff09:

    # mc "*Risa* Lo más parecido a unos ninjas que han pisado esa cocina sois vosotras."
    mc "*Laugh* The closest thing to ninjas that ever set foot in that kitchen is you girls."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:539
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0aa3b3f1:

    # mc "¿Entiendes ahora por qué me siento orgulloso de esta familia?"
    mc "Do you understand now why I am proud of this family?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:541
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c08287e4:

    # ama "*Sollozo* Tienes razones para estarlo... sois increíbles..."
    ama "*Sob* You have every reason to be... you guys are something else..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:542
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b3cff982:

    # mc "Pues sabes que solo te falta una cosa para formar parte de esto, ¿verdad?"
    mc "Well, you know you're just one thing short of being a part of this, right?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:544
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0f516856:

    # ama "¿Esto? *Risita*"
    ama "This? *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:545
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_fc578319:

    # mc "No me refería a eso, pero es un paso. *Risa*"
    mc "That's not what I meant, but it's a step. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:546
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_95de99c5:

    # mc "Quería decir que te falta creerte que puedes formar parte de esta familia. Ya has visto que todas os aceptan y quieren que lo hagáis."
    mc "I wanted to say that you need to believe that you can be part of this family. You've already seen that they all accept you and want you to."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:548
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4a6355a1:

    # ama "¿Tú te lo creerías en nuestro caso? O en tu propio caso. Conoces a una familia hoy, y hoy mismo te están diciendo que perteneces a esa familia."
    ama "Would you believe it in our case? Or in your own case. You meet a family today, and they are telling you right now that you belong to that family."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:549
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f09730a3:

    # ama "No es normal, [mc]."
    ama "It's not normal, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:550
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_f33692bd:

    # mc "No somos normales, Amanda. Ni nosotros ni vosotras."
    mc "We're not normal, Amanda. Neither are we nor you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:551
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_44e3a1a1:

    # mc "Seguramente con cualquier otra familia sería raro, pero... ¿con los Marks? No."
    mc "Surely with any other family it would be weird, but... With the Marks? No."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:552
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_13a93ac1:

    # mc "Las estudiantes hace una semana que llegaron y puedes ver que empiezan a sentirse parte de la familia."
    mc "The students have been here for a week, and you can see they are starting to feel part of it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:553
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_48a938c6:

    # mc "No voy a hablar de Eileen o Scarlett, pero puedes ver que Kiara va por el mismo camino, y lleva... ¿cuánto? ¿Tres días aquí?"
    mc "I'm not going to talk about Eileen or Scarlett, but you can see that Kiara is going the same way, and she's been here for... How long? Three days?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:555
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_9c7743f0:

    # ama "¡Pero todas ellas os han conocido durante más tiempo que nosotras!"
    ama "But they have all known you longer than we have!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:556
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_2b56c964:

    # mc "Te equivocas. Hace tres meses que conoces y vigilas a la familia. Que las estudias. Seguramente sabes más de cada uno de nosotros de lo que nosotros conocemos de otros."
    mc "You are wrong. You've known and watched the family for three months. You have studied them. Surely you know more about each of us than we know about each other."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:557
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_410ae3d4:

    # ama "¡Pero ellas no me conocen de nada! ¡Podría ser una asesina en serie!"
    ama "But they don't know me at all! I could be a serial killer!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:558
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_dddfe8be:

    # mc "¿Puedes dejar de buscar excusas para no sentirte aceptada? No intentes entendernos, y menos aún entender a las mujeres de la familia. Hace más tiempo que las conozco y aún no lo he conseguido."
    mc "Can you stop looking for excuses not to feel accepted? Don't try to understand us, let alone understand the women in the family. I've known them longer than you and still haven't succeeded."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:559
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_ee5ede26:

    # mc "En esta familia todo el mundo es intenso. Aman y odian con intensidad. Los sentimientos brotan a una velocidad que parecería rara fuera de esta casa."
    mc "Everyone in this family is intense. We love and hate with intensity. Feelings bubble up at a speed that would seem bizarre outside of this house."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:560
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_8b9fb15b:

    # mc "No lo analices. Disfrútalo. Te quieren en la familia y tú quieres estar en ella. Haz que sea posible. No huyas de nosotros y mañana lo verás de otra forma."
    mc "Don't analyze it. Enjoy it. They want you in the family and you want to be a part of it. Make it happen. Don't run away from us, and tomorrow you'll see it differently."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:562
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_fbd1fdf6:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]. Por cierto... te odio..."
    ama "Thank you, [mc]. By the way... I hate you..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:563
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4e422bbe:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Qué he hecho ahora? Eso ha sonado muy a [emm]."
    mc "Why? What have I done now? That sounded a lot like [emm]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:564
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_22ed9847:

    # ama "Hacía siete años que no lloraba. Ese espectáculo que has dado ahí dentro no era necesario."
    ama "I haven't cried for seven years. That show you put on in there wasn't necessary."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:565
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_1ea953e8:

    # mc "Sí que lo era, Amanda. Era necesario para que vieras que no sólo somos [mar], [nor], y yo los que pensamos así."
    mc "Yes it was, Amanda. It was necessary for you to see that it's not just [mar], [nor], and me who thinks like that."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:566
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c12424a1:

    # mc "Pero dejemos el tema. ¿Quieres volver dentro?"
    mc "But let's drop the subject. Do you want to go back inside?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:568
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_fe400c94:

    # ama "Sí, pero... ¿se me ha corrido mucho el maquillaje?"
    ama "Yes, but... Did my makeup smear too much?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:569
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_b63098e7:

    # mc "No demasiado. Pareces un grafiti de mapache descolorido bajo la lluvia. *Risa*"
    mc "Not too much. You look like a graffiti of a raccoon fading in the rain. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:571
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e8370e02:

    # ama "¡Capullo! *Risa*"
    ama "Asshole! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:572
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_e3993131:

    # ama "Voy al lavabo a arreglarme y ahora vuelvo a la cocina."
    ama "I'm going to the washroom to fix my makeup, and I'll be back in the kitchen in a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:573
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_7ddde740:

    # mc "Te espero allí."
    mc "I'll wait for you there."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:575
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_49b3f206:

    # kim "¿Está bien?"
    kim "Is she okay?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:576
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_652d4be7:

    # mc "Sí, un poco abrumada, pero bien. Creo que lo que le habéis dicho todas le ha afectado un poco."
    mc "Yes, a little overwhelmed, but she's fine. I think what you all have said to her has affected her a little bit."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:578
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_c9521cc7:

    # kim "Kate y yo estábamos hablando sobre ello mientras estabais fuera."
    kim "Kate and I were talking about it while you were out."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:579
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_68725487:

    # kim "Si el primer día 16 mujeres nos hubieran dicho que somos de la familia no sé cómo nos lo hubiéramos tomado. Seguramente nos hubiéramos reído y no nos lo hubiéramos creído."
    kim "If on the first day 16 women had told us we were family, I don't know how we would have reacted either. We probably would have laughed and not believed it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:580
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_4683e47d:

    # kim "O habríamos salido corriendo."
    kim "Or we would have run away."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:581
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_40ecbecb:

    # mc "Kim, tú sabes lo que es una familia. Y ahora entiendes que si lo hubiéramos dicho el primer día lo hubiéramos sentido."
    mc "Kim, you know what a family is. And now you understand that if we had said it the first day, we would have felt it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:582
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_0aaef5cd:

    # mc "Tardamos cinco días en decirlo."
    mc "It took us five days to say it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:584
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_5e75f3a6:

    # kim "Y durante esos cinco días vimos lo suficiente como para saber que lo decíais en serio."
    kim "And during those five days we saw enough to know that you meant it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:585
translate english c17s001_AmandaDinner_73ca2227:

