    "In your room..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:797
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_f4f5be91:

    # mc "Tu test está en ese cajón, Eileen. Ve a por él. ¿Nerviosa?"
    mc "Your test is in that drawer, Eileen. Go grab it. Nervous?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:798
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_3fd9b16e:

    # eil "Un poco. Llevo días pensando y tengo ganas de que salga positivo."
    eil "A little. I've been thinking about it for days and I'm looking forward to it coming out positive."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:799
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_f41f1e7a:

    # mc "Yo también. Pero solo hay una forma de saberlo. Ve a por él."
    mc "Me too. But there's only one way to find out. Go grab it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:801
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:805
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_3b9e7786:

    # eil "¡Dos verdes! ¡Positivo! ¡Vamos a ser padres!"
    eil "Two greens! Positive! We're going to have a kid!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:806
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_d79bac75:

    # mc "¡Ven aquí, Mami!"
    mc "Come here, Mommy!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:808
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_3fb99fd3:

    # "Os fundís en un abrazo lleno de alegría y de esperanza en que todo vaya bien durante el embarazo."
    "You melt into an embrace full of joy and hope that everything will go well during the pregnancy."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:811
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_06d6d71c:

    # eil "Verde y rojo... negativo..."
    eil "Green and red... negative..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:812
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_227230f0:

    # mc "Lo siento, Eile."
    mc "I'm sorry, Eile."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:813
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_19545459:

    # eil "No pasa nada, cielo. No suele ser el sueño de todas las chicas quedarse embarazada con 21. Y a lo mejor en el columpio lo logramos. Tenemos mucho tiempo."
    eil "It's okay, honey. It's not usually every girl's dream to get pregnant at 21. And maybe, on the swing, we managed to get pregnant. We have plenty of time."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:814
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_474ffb65:

    # mc "Todo el tiempo del mundo. Ven aquí."
    mc "All the time in the world. Come here."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:816
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_10b7d5ca:

    # "Os fundís en un abrazo lleno de esperanza en que el columpio cambie el resultado del siguiente test."
    "You melt into an embrace filled with hope that the swing will change the outcome of the next test."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:817
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_a77c5a71:

    # "Es un abrazo lleno de caricias y besos. Es bueno saber que estáis juntos en esto."
    "It's an embrace full of caresses and kisses. It's good to know you're in this together."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:820
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_c5b34fc4:

    # mc "¿Vas a poder seguir trabajando ahora que estás embarazada? No sé si va a ser bueno para el bebé que estés tantas horas de pie."
    mc "Are you going to be able to keep working now that you're pregnant? I don't know if it's going to be good for the baby for you to be standing so many hours."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:821
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_9dc4a2e6:

    # eil "No hay ningún problema, [mc]. Hay una camarera en el Triangle Dinner que está embarazada de seis meses y dice que no hay ningún problema."
    eil "That's not a problem, [mc]. There's a waitress at the Triangle Diner who's six months pregnant and she says there's no issue."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:822
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_ce8c8e99:

    # mc "¿Has hablado con otras camareras?"
    mc "Have you talked to other waitresses?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:824
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_69d24d7b:

    # eil "Claro, tenía que estar preparada, ¿no? Después de tantos días con síntomas, he hablado con todo el mundo que he podido... menos con mi madre"
    eil "Of course, I needed to be ready, didn't I? After so many days with symptoms, I've talked to everyone I could... except my mother."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:825
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_cbb4b3a7:

    # mc "Bueno, quizás con todo lo que está pasando no sea lo mejor, pero es algo que tú sabes mejor que nadie."
    mc "Well, maybe with everything that's going on it's not the best thing, but it's something you would know better than anyone else."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:827
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_9bd904a5:

    # eil "Me gustaría decírselo lo antes posible, si no te importa. Y me gustaría que se lo dijéramos juntos."
    eil "I'd like to tell her as soon as possible, if you don't mind. And I'd like us to tell her together."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:828
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_5c4eabf8:

    # mc "¿Mañana por la mañana te va bien que se lo digamos? Hoy va a ser un poco complicado. Al acabar la cena tengo que llevar a Amanda de nuevo a su base."
    mc "Would tomorrow morning be okay for us to tell her? Today's going to be a little tricky. After we finish dinner, I have to take Amanda back to her base."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:829
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_6ecaed01:

    # eil "Genial. Mañana se lo contamos. Tengo ganas de ver qué cara pone. ¡Va a ser abuela!"
    eil "Great. We'll tell her tomorrow. I can't wait to see the look on her face - she's going to be a grandmother!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:830
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_9279e00a:

    # mc "Sobre todo hay que decirle que, esta vez, guarde el secreto. Prefiero que no se le vuelva a escapar como en la cocina el otro día."
    mc "Above all, you have to tell her to keep it a secret this time. I'd rather she didn't let it slip again like in the kitchen yesterday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:831
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_b330b8ee:

    # eil "Es mala guardando secretos. *Risa* Pero me aseguraré de que este lo guarde."
    eil "She's bad at keeping secrets. *Laugh* But I'll make sure she keeps this one."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:832
translate english c17s001_EileenPregnancyResult_8205f953:

    # eil "Vamos. Tengo ganas de seguir conociendo a Amanda. Es tan diferente a [emm]..."
    eil "Come on. I'm looking forward to getting to know Amanda further. She's so different from [emm]..."

