    # mc "¡Wow, Maddie! ¡No sabía que pintabas! Parece un templo dedicado a Zeus."
    mc "Wow, Maddie! I didn't know you could paint! It looks like a temple dedicated to Zeus."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2097
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_8a744446:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (¿Sólo lo parece? Maddie, vas a tener que esforzarte más.)"
    zeu "Meow! (It only looks like it? Maddie, you're going to have to try harder.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2098
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_a0536e0b:

    # mad "Solo pinto como hobby. Esa es la pared de la fantasía. Gírate."
    mad "I only paint as a hobby. That's the fantasy wall. Turn around."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2100
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_f26c6b98:

    # mc "*Risa* Me encantan todas, pero especialmente la del rockero."
    mc "*Laugh* I love them all, but especially the one with the guitar and the hood."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2101
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_22c4f4c3:

    # mad "Me divertí mucho pintando esa. Y la que está como un tigre, la pinté el día que lo adopté."
    mad "I had a lot of fun painting that one. And the one he's posing as a tiger; I painted that one the day I adopted him."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2102
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_0fd1a789:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (Ahí estaba yo, apuntando maneras y siendo fiero.)"
    zeu "Meow! (There I was, showing my personality and being fierce.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2117
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_4ec8d291:

    # mc "¿Y ese cuadro? ¿Es en lo que estás trabajando ahora?"
    mc "What about that painting? Is that what you're working on now?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2118
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_7344a38d:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (¡Super-michi!)"
    zeu "Meow! (Super-Kitty!)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2119
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_2ebbe23f:

    # mad "[dap] me dijo que el domingo es su cumpleaños, el de [eri], y el de [emm]."
    mad "[dap] told me that on Sunday is her birthday, and [eri]'s and [emm]'s too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2120
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_d4b8601b:

    # mad "Le pregunté si le gustaría un cuadro y me dijo que sí. Este es para ella. Decidí hacerles un cuadro para cada una."
    mad "I asked her if she would like a painting and she was excited about it. This one is for her. I decided to make a painting for each of them as my gift."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2121
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_36aeb1de:

    # zeu "*Grrr* ¡Miau! (Y con el de [emm] me dieron ganas de cagarme en tu almohada.)"
    zeu "*Grrr* Meow! (And the [emm] one made me want to shit on your pillow.)"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2122
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_b4a6ec6f:

    # mc "Supongo que te ha invitado a la comida del domingo, ¿no?"
    mc "I assume she invited you to the Sunday lunch, didn't she?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2137
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_8991d72d:

    # mad "Sí, me dijo que fuera a comer y me quedara para la partida de DnD. ¿Por qué?"
    mad "Yes, she told me to go to lunch and stay for the DnD game. Why?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2138
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_040470f4:

    # mc "Entonces tengo que contarte una cosa. Siéntate, por favor."
    mc "Then I have to tell you something. Please sit down."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2153
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_5f74a1af:

    # "Después de La Clonversación..."
    "After The Clonversation..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2154
translate english c17s002_ZeusArrival_7863e2a8:

    # mad "Es increíble. Pero me parece que tomáis demasiados riesgos explicándoselo a tanta gente. Yo incluida."
    mad "That's incredible. But I think that you take too many risks explaining it to so many people. Me included."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2171
translate english c17s002_Rom1_4be7d4ea:

    # mc "Bueno... tú y yo aún no hemos hablado de lo que somos, pero creo que vamos hacia algún sitio donde la confianza es indispensable."
    mc "Well... you and I haven't talked about what we are yet, but I think we're headed somewhere where trust is a must."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2173
translate english c17s002_Rom1_df81dc24:

    # mad "Gracias, [mc]. Creo que tenemos muchas cosas de las que hablar... después de que retrasaras la cita..."
    mad "Thank you, [mc]. I think we have a lot to talk about... after you delayed the date..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2175
translate english c17s002_Rom1_a337f597:

    # mad "Por un momento he pensado que querías cancelarla, en vez de retrasarla. He pensado que... que era porque intenté chantajearte."
    mad "For a moment I thought you wanted to cancel it, instead of delaying it. I thought that... that it was because I tried to blackmail you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2176
translate english c17s002_Rom1_535d5ef9:

    # mad "He empezado a montarme películas en mi mente diciéndome que la había cagado por intentarlo... que quizás lo habías pensado mejor y no querías estar conmigo..."
    mad "I've started to build stories in my mind telling myself that I screwed up by trying... that maybe you had thought better about it and didn't want to be with me..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2177
translate english c17s002_Rom1_0e471ac5:

    # mc "No, Maddie. Empezamos esto de una forma que no me gustó, pero me está gustando a dónde va."
    mc "No, Maddie. We started this in a way I didn't like, but I'm liking where it's going."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2179
translate english c17s002_Rom1_e27df326:

    # mad "Por un momento he pensado que querías cancelarla, en vez de retrasarla. Que no querías que nos viéramos."
    mad "For a moment I thought you wanted to cancel it, instead of delaying it. That you didn't want us to see each other."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2180
translate english c17s002_Rom1_425bf1d8:

    # mc "No, Maddie. Cuando fui a comprarte el disfraz, no tenía intención de empezar nada contigo, pero ahora me está gustando a dónde va esto."
    mc "No, Maddie. When I went to buy the costume, I had no intention of starting anything with you, but now I'm liking where this is going."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2181
translate english c17s002_Rom1_1af405b2:

    # mc "Y creo que es el momento de comprobarlo, ¿no?"
    mc "And I think it's time to continue with it, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2184
translate english c17s002_Sub1_f1949ecd:

    # mc "Bueno, no creo que mi gatita vaya a hacer nada que me perjudique. A mí o a mi familia."
    mc "Well, I don't think my kitty is going to do anything to harm me. Me or my family."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2185
translate english c17s002_Sub1_76b2116f:

    # mc "Sabes que espié a [mar] en el probador y has guardado el secreto. No por voluntad propia, pero lo has hecho."
    mc "You know I spied on [mar] in the fitting room, and you've kept the secret. Not willingly, but you have."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2186
translate english c17s002_Sub1_94622999:

    # mc "Y no creo que lo revelaras aunque te liberase de sea lo que sea lo que es esto."
    mc "And I don't think you would reveal it even if I released you from whatever this is."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2188
translate english c17s002_Sub1_b864f71d:

    # mad "Nunca haría algo que os perjudique. Cuando has llamado para retrasar la cita... por un momento he pensado que querías cancelarla."
    mad "I would never do anything to harm you. When you called to delay the date... for a moment I thought you wanted to cancel it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2189
translate english c17s002_Sub1_95b557c6:

    # mad "El corazón me ha dado un vuelco y he descubierto que me gusta lo que tenemos. Que quiero más."
    mad "My heart has skipped a beat and I've discovered that I like what we have. That I want more."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2190
translate english c17s002_Sub1_b4c822bc:

    # mad "Me acabas de llamar gatita y he notado mariposas en el estómago. Quiero ser tu gatita, [mc]. Me gusta sentirme indefensa en tus brazos."
    mad "You just called me kitty and I felt butterflies in my stomach. I want to be your kitten, [mc]. I like feeling helpless in your arms."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2191
translate english c17s002_Sub1_d82d413c:

    # mc "Eres mi gatita, pero no consiste en que estés indefensa. Consiste en que nos lo pasemos bien los dos, no sólo yo."
    mc "You are my kitty, but it's not about you being helpless. It's about both of us having a good time, not just me."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2192
translate english c17s002_Sub1_efdb86d5:

    # mc "Y creo que es el momento de empezar a hacerlo."
    mc "And I think it's time to start doing it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2195
translate english c17s002_Dom1_28ef5b11:

    # mc "Creo que es algo que debes saber. Sabes que espié a [mar] en el probador y has guardado el secreto."
    mc "I think it's something you should know. You know I spied on [mar] in the fitting room, and you've kept the secret."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2196
translate english c17s002_Dom1_4258d6c5:

    # mc "Forzándome a esta relación, pero lo has hecho."
    mc "Forcing me into this relationship, but you have kept te secret."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2197
translate english c17s002_Dom1_4c56a055:

    # mc "Y estoy seguro de que, si dejásemos esta relación, seguirías guardándolo."
    mc "And I'm sure that, if we were to drop this relationship, you would still keep the secret."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2199
translate english c17s002_Dom1_eb23b7db:

    # mad "No tengo intención de hacer nada que te perjudique. Si acabarais todos en prisión me quedaría sin mi juguete."
    mad "I have no intention of doing anything to harm you. If you all ended up in prison, I would be without my toy."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2200
translate english c17s002_Dom1_b7b1e079:

    # mad "Y sí, puedo guardar los secretos que sean necesarios. Me gusta tenerte. Poseerte. ¿Quién sabe si algún día algo más?"
    mad "And yes, I can keep as many secrets as necessary. I like having you. Possessing you. Who knows if someday it will become something else?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2201
translate english c17s002_Dom1_939762a1:

    # mad "Cuándo has llamado para retrasar la cita por un momento he pensado en qué haría si, en vez de retrasarla, la quisieras cancelar."
    mad "When you called to delay the date, for a moment I thought about what I would do if, instead of delaying it, you wanted to cancel it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2202
translate english c17s002_Dom1_a9161cd3:

    # mad "¿Contarle el secreto a [mar] o no? He decidido que no lo haría. Quiero que seas mi juguete, pero quiero que lo seas por voluntad propia, no porque te sientas obligado."
    mad "To tell [mar] the secret or not? I've decided I wouldn't. I want you to be my toy, but I want you to be my toy of your own free will, not because you feel compelled."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2203
translate english c17s002_Dom1_eb3149a8:

    # mc "Un día, cuando esté autorizado para hacerlo, te contaré otro secreto. Uno que te demostrará que, si estoy aquí, es porque quiero."
    mc "One day, when I am authorized to do so, I will tell you another secret. One that will prove to you that, if I'm here, it's because I want to be."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2205
translate english c17s002_Dom1_c018a585:

    # mad "Pues, como premio por ello y por la confianza, y sabiendo que te gusta, te voy a permitir de nuevo que me comas. Lo hiciste muy bien el otro día."
    mad "Well, as a reward for that and the trust, and knowing that you like it, I'm going to let you eat me again. You did very well the other day."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2206
translate english c17s002_Dom1_d0ff99b0:

    # mc "Como mi ama desee. Déjame que te libere de ese mono."
    mc "As my mistress desires. Let me release you from that bodysuit."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2210
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_73a1810a:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DÍA 18 – SABADO{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 19 - SATURDAY{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2213
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_2d236d61:

    # "Después de desayunar coges un par de tests de embarazo y vas a la habitación de [dap] y Scarlett."
    "After breakfast you grab a couple of pregnancy tests and go to [dap] and Scarlett's room."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2215
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_786f9ea0:

    # "Después de desayunar coges un test de embarazo y vas a la habitación de [dap] y Scarlett."
    "After breakfast you take a pregnancy test and go to [dap] and Scarlett's room."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2217
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_a1f6b6b6:

    # "También llevas el test de ADN que Amanda te dio ayer. No sabes cuál de los tests tienes más ganas de que salga positivo."
    "You're also carrying the DNA test Amanda gave you yesterday. You are not sure which of the tests you are more eager for it to turn out positive."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2219
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2220
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_8666b80b:

    # mc "Soy yo. ¿Puedo pasar?"
    mc "It's me. May I come in?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2221
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_7cc88e14:

    # dap "*A través de la puerta* Sí, entra."
    dap "*Through the door* Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2223
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_8defc866:

    # mc "Buenos días. Ha llegado el vampiro. Saaaangreeee. *Risa*"
    mc "Good morning. The vampire has arrived. Blooood. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2226
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_0b787fe4:

    # dap "Buenos días, mi amor."
    dap "Good morning, my love."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2227
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_53d46762:

    # dap "No va a doler, ¿verdad?"
    dap "It's not going to hurt, is it?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2228
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_b0f06ca1:

    # mc "Es sólo un pinchazo."
    mc "It's just a prick in the finger."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2230
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_e4fd25d6:

    # dap "Buenos días, [mc]."
    dap "Good morning, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2233
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_4ac57d7f:

    # sca "Buenos días, guapísimo."
    sca "Good morning, handsome."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2234
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_9a653b5a:

    # sca "Tendremos el resultado mañana a estas horas, ¿no?"
    sca "We'll have the result by this time tomorrow, won't we?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2235
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_402ea49e:

    # mc "Sí. 24 horas para tenerlo."
    mc "Yes. It needs 24 hours to process the blood."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2238
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_0dd349a4:

    # dap "Si los dos salieran positivos sería un regalo de cumpleaños perfecto."
    dap "If both came out positive it would be a perfect birthday present."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2239
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_ea37cb2d:

    # dap "Confirmaríamos que voy a ser madre y tía el día de mi cumpleaños."
    dap "We would confirm that I am going to be a mother and an aunt on my birthday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2242
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_7b1ca3d6:

    # dap "Si os saliera positivo sería un regalo de cumpleaños perfecto. Confirmaríais que voy a ser tía el día de mi cumpleaños."
    dap "If you tested positive, it would be a perfect birthday present. It would confirm that I'm going to be an aunt on my birthday."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2245
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_39666345:

    # sca "Tengo ganas de convertirme en la Tía Scarlett."
    sca "I feel like becoming Aunt Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2247
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_ffba44e4:

    # mc "¿Ya os tratáis como hermanas?"
    mc "Do you already treat each other as sisters?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2249
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_049a02bb:

    # dap "¡Por supuesto!" (multiple=2)
    dap "Of course!" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2250
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_e835f5f0:

    # sca "¿Esperabas algo diferente?" (multiple=2)
    sca "Did you expect any different?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2251
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_c3b58748:

    # mc "*Risa* No."
    mc "*Laugh* No."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2254
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_63455027:

    # "Tomas las muestras de sangre y cada una etiqueta su prueba con una pegatina de colores. Las guardáis en un armario, detrás de la ropa de invierno donde nadie lo va a encontrar"
    "You take the blood samples and each of them label their test with a colored sticker. They put the tests in a closet, behind the winter clothes where no one will find them."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2256
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_2fabfc4c:

    # "Tomas las muestras de sangre y guardáis la prueba en un armario, detrás de la ropa de invierno donde nadie lo va a encontrar."
    "You take the blood sample and put the test in a closet, behind the winter clothes where no one is going to find it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2259
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_4b8aa236:

    # sca "Y ahora viene mi prueba de ADN, ¿no? ¿Más sangre?"
    sca "And now comes my DNA test, right? More blood?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2260
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_a69a9b84:

    # mc "No, en este caso es sólo frotar con un hisopo en la parte interior de la mejilla."
    mc "No, in this case, it's just rubbing with a swab on the inside of the cheek."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2262
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_0db9aefc:

    # dap "Tienes que estar super emocionada. Después de haberte dado por vencida, encontrar esa nueva pista tiene que haber sido increíble."
    dap "You have to be super excited. After giving up on knowing who your father is, finding that new lead should have been mind blowing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2264
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_a94283b6:

    # sca "*Ggl GGL*"
    sca "*Ggl GGL*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2265
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_fc6aba68:

    # mc "Espera un segundo, que ya acabo."
    mc "Hold on a second, I'm just finishing."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2267
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_f113cffc:

    # sca "La verdad es que sí. Ha sido un golpe de suerte. A mi madre no le iba a sacar nada más que mentiras..."
    sca "The truth is that it's exciting. It was a stroke of luck. I wasn't going to get anything but lies out of my mother..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2269
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_97225993:

    # dap "Y supongo que no me vas a decir quién es el candidato."
    dap "And I suppose you're not going to tell me who the candidate is."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2271
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_2c9e1144:

    # sca "Ya te he dicho que no puedo. Si sale negativo podría manchar su reputación."
    sca "I've already told you I can't. If it comes out negative it could tarnish his reputation."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2273
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_c404c4ce:

    # dap "Manchar su reputación... Mmmmm..."
    dap "Tarnish his reputation... Mmmmm..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2274
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_e77b4932:

    # dap "Pero tú sabes que yo guardaría el secreto, ¿verdad? Sabes que puedes confiar en mi para cualquier cosa."
    dap "But you know I'd keep the secret, right? You know you can trust me with anything."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2276
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_e6aaf868:

    # sca "Sí, [dap], pero pese a todo prefiero no decir nada hasta que no tengamos los resultados."
    sca "I know, [dap], but I still prefer not to say anything until we have the results."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2278
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_17149a79:

    # "... {w} ... {w}... {w}..."
    "... {w} ... {w}... {w}..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2280
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_c60959de:

    # dap "¡Tío Edmund!"
    dap "Uncle Edmund!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2282
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_7c7a67dc:

    # mc "¿Qué?" (multiple=2)
    mc "What?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2283
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_b07c80f3:

    # sca "¿Cómo?" (multiple=2)
    sca "How?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2285
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_34e05fdf:

    # dap "Ha sido fácil de deducir. No quieres manchar su reputación diciéndomelo a mí, lo que significa que lo conozco. Y lo tengo que conocer bien."
    dap "It was too easily deduced. You don't want to tarnish his reputation by telling me, which means I know him. And I have to know him well."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2286
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_8b324b1f:

    # dap "La mayoría de los profesores del instituto son demasiado jóvenes para ser tus padres o lo más probable es que estuvieran solteros cuando te concibieron, con lo que no habría reputación que manchar."
    dap "Most high school teachers are either too young to be your father or most likely they were unmarried when you were conceived, so there would be no reputation to tarnish."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2289
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_d4964de3:

    # dap "Eso dejaba a mi padre, al Tío Daniel, al Tío Dominic, y al Tío Edmund como candidatos."
    dap "That would leave my father, Uncle Daniel, Uncle Dominic, and Uncle Edmund as candidates."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2291
translate english c17s003_DapScaTests_0880be6c:

    # dap "Eso dejaba como candidatos al tío Edmund o a mi padre... bueno... mi padre..."
    dap "That would leave either Uncle Edmund or my father as candidates... well... my father..."

