    "It will take Amanda a while to stop feeling like an animal on display."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2572
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_a3ab48a9:

    # "Esta vez las chicas tienen una nueva presa. Megan."
    "This time the girls have a new prey. Megan."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2574
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_5afeb14d:

    # nor "Amanda nos ha contado las noticias. Ya no corremos peligro."
    nor "Amanda told us the news. We are no longer in danger."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2575
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_1ad31beb:

    # mc "Son grandes noticias. Aaron parece estar haciendo un trabajo fantástico."
    mc "That's great news. Aaron seems to be doing a terrific job."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2576
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_1709dc65:

    # mc "Aún estoy dudando de si debería aceptar el trabajo en Aruba... eso si no vendemos, claro. No sé si estaré a la altura."
    mc "I'm still on the fence about whether I should take the job in Aruba... that's if we don't sell, of course. I don't know if I'll be up to it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2578
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_9e14d892:

    # nor "[mar] y yo no queremos vender la empresa."
    nor "[mar] and I don't want to sell the company."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2579
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_6a6a997a:

    # nor "Hacerlo significaría que habrá más chicas como Eva y Amanda. Mas niñas como Fiona."
    nor "Doing so would mean that there would be more girls like Eva and Amanda. More little girls like Fiona."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2580
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_d1cc2333:

    # mc "Yo también creo que deberíamos mantenerla en manos de la familia."
    mc "I also feel that we should keep it in the hands of the family."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2582
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_7c22c332:

    # nor "Y cuando te refieres a familia, también te refieres a Eva y a Amanda, ¿no?"
    nor "And when you mean family, you also mean Eva and Amanda, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2583
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_6f883578:

    # mc "Para mí, ellas son las principales víctimas de NTR. No sólo ellas. También Aaron y el resto de los clones masculinos. Incluidos los que entraron en casa."
    mc "For me, they are the main victims of NTR. Not only them. Also Aaron and the rest of the male clones. Including the ones who broke into the house."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2584
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_9dc882bc:

    # mc "Y, obviamente, ellas son familia. Ya viste cómo se puso Amanda ayer cuando se sintió aceptada. No quiero que nadie les robe eso. Ya le han robado su infancia."
    mc "And, obviously, they are family. You saw how Amanda looked yesterday when she felt accepted. I don't want anyone to steal that from them. They've already robbed them of their childhood."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2586
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_7c4baacf:

    # nor "[dap] y [eri] tampoco quieren vender. Estoy muy orgullosa de ellas."
    nor "[dap] and [eri] don't want to sell either. I'm so proud of them."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2587
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_c934662b:

    # nor "[emm] dice que tiene dudas, pero no ha dicho sobre qué."
    nor "[emm] says she has doubts, but has not said about what."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2588
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_a97a789f:

    # mc "Hablaré con [emm] sobre ello. Ayer ya quería gastarse el dinero en un coche deportivo... rosa."
    mc "I'll talk to [emm] about it. Yesterday she already wanted to spend the money on a sports car... a pink sports car."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2589
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2f1c36fd:

    # mc "Ya sabes que a veces necesita un empujón en la dirección correcta."
    mc "You know she sometimes needs a push in the right direction."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2590
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_190da926:

    # mc "Ahora te voy a dejar un momento. Tengo que hablar con Kiara y quiero aprovechar ahora que se ha quedado sola."
    mc "Now I will leave you for a moment. I have to talk to Kiara and I want to take advantage of the fact that she is alone for the first time."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2592
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_b028b239:

    # nor "Ve. Es casi tan popular como Amanda y Eva. Es difícil que esté sola más de unos minutos. También es novedad, parece mentira que sólo sea su cuarto día en casa."
    nor "Go. She's almost as popular as Amanda and Eva. It's hard for her to be alone for more than a few minutes. She's also a novelty, it seems unbelievable that it's only her fourth day at home."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2594
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_e6e912ec:

    # mc "¿Qué tal, Kiara?"
    mc "How are you doing, Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2596
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_1b271947:

    # kia "Muy contenta con las noticias de antes. *Susurrando* Aunque ser abuela me haga sentir vieja."
    kia "Very happy with the news from earlier. *Whispering* Even though being a grandmother makes me feel old."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2597
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_62e5c781:

    # kia "Y alucinando con lo rápido que se está integrando todo el mundo."
    kia "And just flipping out at how fast everyone is integrating."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2599
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_933ac119:

    # kia "Alucinando con lo rápido que se está integrando todo el mundo."
    kia "Just flipping out at how fast everyone is integrating."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2600
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_3737e771:

    # mc "¿Y tú? ¿Qué tal llevas la integración?"
    mc "How about you? How are you handling the integration?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2602
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_802b957c:

    # kia "Genial. Me siento muy a gusto aquí, con vosotros."
    kia "Great. I feel very comfortable here with you guys."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2603
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_eb881cfe:

    # kia "Te tengo que dejar. Tenía que comentarle algo a Betty."
    kia "I need to leave you. I had to discuss something with Betty."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2604
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_ec12d61d:

    # mc "¿He hecho algo malo, Kiara?"
    mc "Did I do something wrong, Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2606
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_36159e09:

    # kia "¿Por qué dices eso?"
    kia "Why are you asking that?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2607
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_4c4ce05e:

    # mc "Me da la impresión de que me estás evitando desde hace un par de días."
    mc "I get the feeling that you've been avoiding me for a couple of days now."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2608
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_30fd5f10:

    # kia "No... no te estoy evitando."
    kia "No... I'm not avoiding you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2609
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_d4d39668:

    # mc "¿Entonces qué pasa? Desde que fuimos a tu casa parece que no estás cómoda cuando yo estoy alrededor."
    mc "So what's going on, then? Since we went to your house you don't seem to be comfortable when I'm around."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2611
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_e01c898b:

    # mc "¿Es por lo que pasó en la cocina? ¿Por mis relaciones? ¿Por los besos? ¿Por lo que pasó en tu casa con Solomon?"
    mc "Is it because of what happened in the kitchen? Because of my relationships? Because of the kissing? Because of what happened at your house with Solomon?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2613
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_810f89d7:

    # mc "¿Es porque estoy con Eileen? ¿Por los besos? ¿Por lo que pasó en tu casa con Solomon?"
    mc "Is it because I'm dating Eileen? Because of the kissing? Because of what happened at your house with Solomon?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2615
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_5db4f1fd:

    # mc "¿Es por los besos? ¿Por lo que pasó en tu casa con Solomon?"
    mc "Is it because of the kissing? Because of what happened at your house with Solomon?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2617
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_85f5d6ea:

    # kia "No es que esté incómoda a tu alrededor..."
    kia "It's not that I'm uncomfortable around you..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2618
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_e6e4d5d1:

    # kia "No estoy acostumbrada a que nadie, excepto Eileen, me defienda como hiciste tú en casa."
    kia "I'm not used to anyone but Eileen standing up for me like you did at my house."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2620
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_adcd819b:

    # kia "Por un momento me sentí como se deben sentir las princesas en los cuentos de hadas. Protegida. Segura."
    kia "For a moment, I felt like how princesses in fairy tales must feel. Protected. Safe."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2622
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_4fc78872:

    # kia "Después... cuando nos abrazamos los tres en el parque... me sentí rara."
    kia "Then... when the three of us hugged in the park... I felt awkward."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2623
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_d18e63c2:

    # mc "¿Rara? ¿Por qué? Sólo fue un abrazo. Siempre te han gustado mis abrazos."
    mc " Awkward? Why? It was just a hug. You always liked my hugs."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2625
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_963696e9:

    # kia "Si te lo explicara no lo entenderías. Y además me sentiría estúpida explicándotelo."
    kia "If I explained it to you, you wouldn't understand. And, besides that, I would feel stupid trying to tell you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2626
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_bd357dbf:

    # mc "Puedes probar a hacerlo. Hay gente que dice que no soy tan tonto como parezco."
    mc "You can try doing it. Some people say I'm not as dumb as I look."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2627
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_ffbec445:

    # kia "No es eso. Pero no te preocupes. No es que hayas hecho nada... malo."
    kia "It's not that. But don't worry. You didn't do anything... wrong."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2629
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_820442c5:

    # "Kiara empieza a comprobar la cocina, claramente buscando a alguien con quien hablar para librarse de ti."
    "Kiara starts checking the kitchen, clearly looking for someone to talk to. To have an excuse to get rid of you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2631
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_c1437193:

    # kia "Debería ir a hablar con..."
    kia "I should go talk to..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2633
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_a636911b:

    # mc "Ve con Betty si tienes que ir, pero no huyas de mí, por favor. No huyas de nosotros."
    mc "Go with Betty if you have to, but don't run away from me, please. Don't run away from us."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2635
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_8f0de41c:

    # kia "No quiero huir, [mc]."
    kia "I don't want to run away, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2636
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_67d1140b:

    # kia "Es... es... complicado..."
    kia "It's... it's... complicated..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2640
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_b68a7078:

    # kia "¡No! ¡No es complicado!"
    kia "No! It's not complicated!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2642
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_9f178ca7:

    # kia "*Susurrando* ¡Vas a ser el padre de mis nietos!"
    kia "*Whispering* You're going to be the father of my grandchild!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2644
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_be9da35d:

    # kia "*Susurrando* ¡Estás con mi hija!"
    kia "*Whispering* You're dating my daughter!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2645
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_979136c5:

    # kia "¡Soy una mujer casada!"
    kia "I'm a married woman!"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2646
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_ae009029:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Qué tiene que ver eso?"
    mc "What? What's that got to do with anything?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2648
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_d5ea279d:

    # kia "Ya te he dicho que no lo entenderías si te lo explicaba."
    kia "I already told you that you wouldn't understand if I explained it to you."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2649
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_8064e907:

    # mc "Pero no me has explicado nada..."
    mc "But you didn't explain anything..."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2650
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_4431a7d9:

    # mc "¿Qué me he perdido?"
    mc "What did I miss?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2651
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_3a905abb:

    # bet "Al final resultará que no eres tan listo como yo pensaba."
    bet "At the end of the day, it seems that you're not as smart as I thought you were."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2653
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_7e715a92:

    # mc "Hola, Tía Betty. ¿Qué quieres decir?"
    mc "Hi, Aunt Betty. What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2654
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_a58eca9e:

    # bet "No eres capaz de descubrir lo que le pasa a Kiara por ti mismo, ¿verdad?"
    bet "You're not able to figure out what's wrong with Kiara on your own, are you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2655
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_def038df:

    # mc "¿Sinceramente? No tengo ni idea de lo que está pasando ni de a qué te refieres."
    mc "Honestly? I have no idea what's going on or what you're talking about."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2657
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_982f271f:

    # bet "¿Quieres que te dibuje un plano o prefieres ir a ciegas?"
    bet "Do you want me to draw you a map or do you prefer to go blindly?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2658
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_5e22a342:

    # mc "Una cosa es ir a ciegas, pero ahora voy sin plano, sin linterna, de noche, con los ojos vendados y las manos atadas."
    mc "It's one thing to go blindly. But now I'm going without a map, without a flashlight, at night, blindfolded, and with my hands tied."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2659
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_f594e452:

    # bet "Ven conmigo detrás de la isla. Podremos hablar más tranquilos allí."
    bet "Come with me by the sink. We can talk more at ease there."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2661
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2e2d7e07:

    # bet "¿Qué crees que le pasa a Kiara?"
    bet "What do you think is the matter with Kiara?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2662
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_0c1070b9:

    # mc "No tengo ni idea. Todo iba genial hasta el día que fuimos a su casa. Con lo que lo único que se me ocurre es que fuera por lo que pasó con Solomon."
    mc "I have no idea. Everything was going great until the day we went to her house. The only thing I can think of is that it was because of what happened with Solomon."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2663
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2f111123:

    # bet "Estamos hablando del mismo día en que empezamos los saludos con besos otra vez, ¿no? Culpa mía."
    bet "We're talking about the same day we started the kissing greetings again, aren't we? My fault."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2664
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_00e8602f:

    # mc "Sí, claro. Fue el mismo día."
    mc "Yes, of course. It was the same day."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2666
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_3898f5d9:

    # bet "Después de lo que pasó en la cocina."
    bet "After what happened in the kitchen."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2668
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_df1b9f4a:

    # bet "Y de que descubriera que estás con Samantha."
    bet "And that she found out you're dating Samantha."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2669
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_4a80ff50:

    # mc "Sí, pero sigo sin ver que tiene que ver eso. Hasta que llegamos a su casa todo iba bien. Cuando nos fuimos también."
    mc "Yes, but I still can't see what that has to do with it. Until we got to her house everything was fine. When we left too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2670
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_c0a91882:

    # mc "Pero desde que volvimos a casa está distante conmigo. No entiendo ese cambio en los diez minutos que hay de su casa a aquí."
    mc "But since we've been back home, she's been distant with me. I don't understand that change in the ten minutes from her house to here."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2672
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_9f95f68a:

    # bet "¿Te apetece jugar a un juego?"
    bet "Do you feel like playing a game?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2673
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_02614fa0:

    # mc "Preferiría que me dijeras que crees que le pasa."
    mc "I'd rather you tell me what you think is wrong with her."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2675
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_546dfd31:

    # bet "No te lo voy a decir. Podría haber sacado conclusiones equivocadas. Este juego lo inventó Olivia para [emm], pero también puede servir para ti."
    bet "I'm not going to tell you. I might have jumped to the wrong conclusions. This game was invented by Olivia for [emm], but it can work for you, too."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2676
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_598ca576:

    # mc "Adelante. Juguemos. Explícame las normas."
    mc "Go ahead. Let's play. Tell me the rules."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2677
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2e734c76:

    # bet "Las normas son fáciles. Yo hago preguntas y tú respondes tras pensar cinco segundos."
    bet "The rules are easy. I ask questions, and you answer them after you think for five seconds."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2678
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_1efa927c:

    # mc "*Risa* Ahora entiendo por qué Meemaw lo inventó para [emm]. Adelante."
    mc "*Laugh* Now I understand why Meemaw invented it for [emm]. Go ahead."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2680
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_54e5419f:

    # bet "Fuiste al rescate de Kiara y Eileen el día que abandonaron su casa, ¿verdad?"
    bet "You went to Kiara and Eileen's rescue the day they left home, didn't you?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2681
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_809797bc:

    # mc "Sí. Para eso no necesito pensar cinco segundos."
    mc "Yes. I don't need to think for five seconds to answer that question."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2682
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_64969848:

    # bet "Cierto. La defendiste cuando apareció Solomon. ¿Cómo crees que se debe sentir después de que la rescataras y la defendieras?"
    bet "True. You defended her when Solomon showed up. How do you think she might feel after you rescued her and defended her?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2683
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_7fe66ad7:

    # mc "Para esta tampoco tengo que pensar. Me lo ha dicho ella. Protegida y segura."
    mc "I don't have to think for that one either. She already told me. Protected and safe."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2686
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2db649db:

    # bet "¿Qué crees que debe pensar de tus relaciones?"
    bet "What do you think she must think about your relationships?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2688
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_0fd388f1:

    # bet "¿Y de que, además, estés con su hija?"
    bet "What about you being with her daughter, too?"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2689
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_7758f356:

    # mc "No me lo he planteado. No tiene por qué pensar nada."
    mc "I hadn't thought about it. She doesn't have to think anything about it."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2691
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_ad5c65c9:

    # bet "Yo en su lugar pensaría que no te importa la edad que tengan las mujeres con las que sales."
    bet "If I were her, I'd think you don't care how old the women you date are."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2692
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_8cb31597:

    # mc "Y acertarías. La edad es sólo un número y no le presto atención en absoluto."
    mc "And you'd be right. Age is just a number and I don't pay attention to it at all."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2694
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_fe4a498a:

    # bet "No hagas público eso o todas las abuelas de California empezarán a perseguirte. *Risa*"
    bet "Don't make that public or all the grandmothers in California will start chasing you. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2695
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_74ec8853:

    # mc "¿Todas? ¿Tú también? *Risa*"
    mc "All of them? You too? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2696
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_2e83fd20:

    # bet "*Risa* Yo no soy abuela. Solo vieja."
    bet "*Laugh* I'm not a grandmother. Just old."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2698
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_09676202:

    # bet "Pero volvamos a Kiara antes de que digas algo inapropiado."
    bet "But let's get back to Kiara before you say something inappropriate."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2699
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_1dbb2843:

    # bet "Un muchacho la rescata dos veces de su marido y la hace sentir protegida y segura. Un muchacho a quien le da lo mismo la edad de su pareja."
    bet "A boy who rescues her twice from her husband and makes her feel protected and safe. A boy who doesn't care how old the women he dates are."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2702
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_6a3f24fc:

    # bet "Entonces tenemos a un muchacho que la ha rescatado dos veces de su marido y que la hace sentir protegida y segura."
    bet "Then we have a boy who has rescued her twice from her husband and who makes her feel protected and safe."

# game/scripts/c17/c17.rpy:2704
translate english c17s003_AmandaLunch_3f3d0a2c:

    # bet "Y que, para ella, es lo suficientemente bueno como para estar con su hija. Eso es importante y lo tienes que ver con mentalidad de madre."
